(window.AFYA_TX=window.AFYA_TX||{})["fh"]={"fh_wnd_fabpl":[["Fabric plasters are flexible adhesive strips with a small absorbent pad, made to cover minor cuts and grazes on parts of the body that bend and move, such as fingers, knuckles and knees. Choose an assorted box so the family has long strips, small spots and wide patches for different wounds; breathable fabric with a non-stick pad is gentler on healing skin than plain plastic, and bright character plasters help children accept a dressing. Clean the wound with clean water first, dry the skin around it, and change the plaster daily or whenever it gets wet or dirty. A family with school-age children typically uses 20–40 plasters a month, so a 100-pack lasts a household about three months. Afya stocks good-adhesion fabric plasters at value and premium price points because they are the most-used item in every home first-aid box.","Plasta za kitambaa ni vipande vinavyonata na kunyumbulika vyenye pedi ndogo ya kufyonza, vilivyotengenezwa kufunika mikato midogo na michubuko kwenye sehemu za mwili zinazokunjika na kusogea, kama vidole, vifundo na magoti. Chagua boksi lenye saizi mchanganyiko ili familia iwe na vipande virefu, vidoti vidogo na viraka vipana kwa vidonda tofauti; kitambaa kinachopitisha hewa chenye pedi isiyonata kwenye kidonda ni laini zaidi kwa ngozi inayopona kuliko plastiki tupu, na plasta zenye picha za wahusika huwasaidia watoto kukubali kufungwa. Safisha kidonda kwa maji safi kwanza, kausha ngozi inayokizunguka, na badilisha plasta kila siku au kila inapolowa au kuchafuka. Familia yenye watoto wa umri wa shule kwa kawaida hutumia plasta 20–40 kwa mwezi, hivyo pakiti ya 100 hudumu takriban miezi mitatu. Afya inauza plasta za kitambaa zinazonata vizuri kwa bei nafuu na bei ya juu kwa sababu ndizo bidhaa inayotumika zaidi katika kila kisanduku cha huduma ya kwanza nyumbani."],["Bought by every household and every school bag, with a fast refill cycle and strong basket-add value.","Inanunuliwa na kila kaya na kila begi la shule, hujazwa mara kwa mara na huongeza thamani ya kikapu."]],"fh_wnd_wppl":[["Waterproof plasters use a thin plastic or polyurethane film that keeps water and dirt out while the wound heals, so they stay on through handwashing, bathing, cooking and rain. They suit people whose hands are wet much of the day — cooks, cleaners, mothers washing nappies and market traders — and anyone with a small wound during the long rains. Look for a sealed edge on all four sides and a pad that does not stick to the wound; clear film plasters are discreet on the face and hands. Because a covered wound under a sealed film can become soggy, change the plaster at least once a day and leave it off at night if the cut is dry and closed. Afya stocks a low-cost 100-pack for families and premium water-resistant strips for people who need all-day hold.","Plasta zisizopitisha maji hutumia filamu nyembamba ya plastiki au polyurethane inayozuia maji na uchafu wakati kidonda kinapona, hivyo hubaki mahali pake wakati wa kunawa mikono, kuoga, kupika na mvua. Zinawafaa watu ambao mikono yao huwa na maji muda mwingi wa siku — wapishi, wasafishaji, akina mama wanaofua nepi na wafanyabiashara wa sokoni — na mtu yeyote mwenye kidonda kidogo wakati wa masika. Tafuta plasta yenye ukingo uliofungwa pande zote nne na pedi isiyonata kwenye kidonda; plasta za filamu angavu hazionekani sana usoni na mikononi. Kwa kuwa kidonda kilichofunikwa chini ya filamu iliyofungwa kinaweza kulowana, badilisha plasta angalau mara moja kwa siku na uiache wazi usiku ikiwa mkato umekauka na kufunga. Afya inauza pakiti ya 100 ya bei nafuu kwa familia na vipande vya hali ya juu visivyopitisha maji kwa wanaohitaji kushika siku nzima."],["Solves a daily frustration for wet-handed workers and sells strongly in the rains alongside fabric plasters.","Inatatua tatizo la kila siku kwa wanaofanya kazi na maji na huuzika sana wakati wa mvua pamoja na plasta za kitambaa."]],"fh_wnd_gauze":[["Sterile gauze swabs are folded squares of woven cotton gauze packed so that they are free of germs until opened, and they are the basic material for cleaning a wound, applying antiseptic and pressing firmly on a bleeding cut. The common sizes are 7.5 × 7.5 cm (3 × 3 inch) for small wounds and 10 × 10 cm (4 × 4 inch) for larger ones; choose individually wrapped swabs for a travel kit and boxes of 100 for home carers changing dressings daily. Wash your hands, open the pack without touching the part that will meet the wound, and never reuse a swab. A family uses a few swabs a month, while someone caring for a leg ulcer or a surgical wound can use 60–100. Afya keeps single swabs for small budgets and boxes of 100 for carers and clinics.","Gozi tasa ni vipande vya pamba iliyofumwa vilivyokunjwa na kufungwa ili visiwe na vijidudu hadi vitakapofunguliwa, na ndivyo vifaa vya msingi vya kusafisha kidonda, kupaka dawa ya kuua vijidudu na kubana kwa nguvu mkato unaotoa damu. Saizi za kawaida ni sentimita 7.5 × 7.5 (inchi 3 × 3) kwa vidonda vidogo na sentimita 10 × 10 (inchi 4 × 4) kwa vikubwa; chagua gozi zilizofungwa kila moja peke yake kwa kisanduku cha safari na boksi za vipande 100 kwa walezi wanaobadilisha bendeji kila siku. Nawa mikono, fungua pakiti bila kugusa sehemu itakayogusa kidonda, na usitumie gozi mara mbili. Familia hutumia gozi chache kwa mwezi, ilhali mtu anayemhudumia mgonjwa mwenye kidonda cha mguu au cha upasuaji anaweza kutumia 60–100. Afya inauza gozi moja moja kwa bajeti ndogo na boksi za 100 kwa walezi na kliniki."],["Low price, constant need from home carers and clinics, and an anchor item that pulls antiseptic and tape into the basket.","Bei ndogo, mahitaji ya kudumu kutoka kwa walezi na kliniki, na bidhaa kuu inayovuta dawa ya vidonda na tepu kwenye kikapu."]],"fh_wnd_pad":[["A non-adherent dressing pad has an absorbent core covered by a perforated film, so it soaks up fluid without sticking to the healing wound and does not tear new skin when it is removed. It is the right choice for knee grazes on children, weeping wounds and minor burns after they have been cooled, and it is held in place with tape or a roller bandage. Use the shiny side towards the wound, choose a pad slightly larger than the wound, and replace it when fluid reaches the edge or at least every one to two days. A typical household needs one pack of five for its first-aid box, while carers use several packs a month. Afya stocks sterile pads because they make dressing changes painless, which is the main reason families avoid changing dressings.","Pedi isiyonata ina kiini kinachofyonza kilichofunikwa na filamu yenye vitundu, hivyo hufyonza majimaji bila kunata kwenye kidonda kinachopona na haichani ngozi mpya inapoondolewa. Ndiyo chaguo sahihi kwa michubuko ya magoti ya watoto, vidonda vinavyotoa majimaji na kuungua kidogo baada ya kupozwa, na hushikiliwa kwa tepu au bendeji ya kuzungusha. Weka upande unaong’aa kuelekea kidonda, chagua pedi kubwa kidogo kuliko kidonda, na ibadilishe majimaji yanapofika ukingoni au angalau kila siku moja au mbili. Kaya ya kawaida inahitaji pakiti moja ya vipande vitano kwa kisanduku chake cha huduma ya kwanza, ilhali walezi hutumia pakiti kadhaa kwa mwezi. Afya inauza pedi tasa kwa sababu hufanya kubadilisha bendeji kusiwe na maumivu, ambayo ndiyo sababu kuu familia huepuka kubadilisha bendeji."],["Upgrades home wound care beyond plain cotton wool and adds a higher-margin item to every kit sale.","Inaboresha huduma ya vidonda nyumbani zaidi ya pamba tupu na kuongeza bidhaa yenye faida kubwa kwenye kila mauzo ya kisanduku."]],"fh_wnd_isl":[["An island dressing is a large plaster: an absorbent pad in the centre surrounded by a border of soft adhesive, so a single piece cleans up neatly with no separate tape. It is used for wounds too big for ordinary plasters, for stitches after minor surgery or a caesarean section, and for wounds a clinic has asked the family to dress at home. Choose a size where the pad covers the wound with about 1–2 cm to spare; showerproof film versions let the patient bathe, while non-woven versions breathe better in the heat. Change it as advised by the nurse, usually every two to three days or sooner if it leaks, and watch for spreading redness, heat, smell or fever, which need a clinic visit. Afya stocks value, mid and showerproof premium options so families can follow discharge instructions without hunting across several pharmacies.","Bendeji ya kisiwa ni plasta kubwa: pedi ya kufyonza katikati iliyozungukwa na ukingo laini unaonata, hivyo kipande kimoja hufunika kidonda kwa unadhifu bila tepu ya ziada. Hutumika kwa vidonda vikubwa kuliko plasta za kawaida, kwa mishono baada ya upasuaji mdogo au upasuaji wa kujifungua, na kwa vidonda ambavyo kliniki imeiambia familia ivihudumie nyumbani. Chagua saizi ambayo pedi inafunika kidonda na kubaki takriban sentimita 1–2 pembeni; aina za filamu zisizopitisha maji humruhusu mgonjwa kuoga, wakati aina za kitambaa kisichofumwa hupitisha hewa vizuri zaidi wakati wa joto. Ibadilishe kama muuguzi alivyoelekeza, kwa kawaida kila siku mbili hadi tatu au mapema zaidi ikivuja, na angalia wekundu unaosambaa, joto, harufu au homa, ambavyo vinahitaji kwenda kliniki. Afya inauza chaguo la bei nafuu, la kati na la hali ya juu lisilopitisha maji ili familia ziweze kufuata maelekezo ya hospitali bila kuzunguka maduka mengi ya dawa."],["High-value, repeat purchase after every hospital discharge, and a reason for carers to choose Afya over hospital pharmacies.","Bidhaa yenye thamani kubwa inayonunuliwa mara kwa mara baada ya kuruhusiwa hospitali, na sababu ya walezi kuichagua Afya."]],"fh_wnd_roll":[["Gauze roller bandages are light, open-weave rolls used to hold a dressing pad in place on a limb or head, where tape alone will not stay on. Widths of 5–7.5 cm suit hands and arms, while 10–15 cm suits legs and the head; buying in packs of twelve is far cheaper per roll than single rolls. Wrap firmly but not tightly, starting below the wound and overlapping each turn by about half; if fingers or toes go pale, cold, numb or tingly, the bandage is too tight and must be loosened at once. They are single-use for wounds but can be used to secure splints in an emergency. Afya stocks 4-inch and 6-inch twelve-roll packs because they are the cheapest reliable way for families and carers to keep wound dressings in place.","Bendeji za gozi za kuzungusha ni mizunguko myepesi yenye ufumaji wazi inayotumika kushikilia pedi ya kidonda kwenye mkono, mguu au kichwa, mahali ambapo tepu peke yake haishiki. Upana wa sentimita 5–7.5 unafaa kwa viganja na mikono, na sentimita 10–15 unafaa kwa miguu na kichwa; kununua pakiti za mizunguko kumi na mbili ni nafuu zaidi kwa kila mzunguko kuliko kununua mmoja mmoja. Zungusha kwa uthabiti lakini si kwa kubana, ukianzia chini ya kidonda na kufunika kila mzunguko kwa takriban nusu; vidole vikiwa vyeupe, baridi, kufa ganzi au kuwasha-washa, bendeji imebana sana na lazima ilegezwe mara moja. Ni za kutumia mara moja kwa vidonda lakini zinaweza kutumika kufunga banzi wakati wa dharura. Afya inauza pakiti za inchi 4 na inchi 6 zenye mizunguko kumi na mbili kwa sababu ndiyo njia nafuu na ya uhakika kwa familia na walezi kushikilia bendeji za vidonda."],["Very low cost per roll with steady demand from carers, schools and small clinics buying in bulk.","Gharama ndogo sana kwa kila mzunguko na mahitaji ya kudumu kutoka kwa walezi, shule na kliniki ndogo zinazonunua kwa wingi."]],"fh_wnd_crepe":[["Crepe bandages are stretchy cotton bandages that give light compression and support to a sprained joint and hold a cold pack or dressing in place. Choose 7.5 cm for wrists and children, 10 cm for ankles and elbows, and 15 cm for knees and thighs; one or two rolls in each common width make a complete home set. For a sprain, rest the joint, apply a cold pack wrapped in cloth for 15–20 minutes, then wrap from below the joint upwards with even, moderate tension, and remove the bandage at night. Numbness, tingling, swelling below the bandage or blue toes mean it is too tight. A washed crepe bandage can be reused several times, so families buy a few a year, while sports teams and schools buy more. Afya stocks the three key widths at value prices so a sprain can be managed the same day.","Bendeji za krepu ni bendeji za pamba zinazovutika ambazo hutoa mbano mwepesi na msaada kwa kiungo kilichoteguka na kushikilia mfuko wa baridi au bendeji mahali pake. Chagua sentimita 7.5 kwa viganja na watoto, sentimita 10 kwa vifundo vya mguu na viwiko, na sentimita 15 kwa magoti na mapaja; mzunguko mmoja au miwili ya kila upana wa kawaida hutengeneza seti kamili ya nyumbani. Kwa kuteguka, pumzisha kiungo, weka mfuko wa baridi uliofungwa kwa kitambaa kwa dakika 15–20, kisha zungusha kuanzia chini ya kiungo kwenda juu kwa mvuto wa wastani ulio sawa, na uondoe bendeji usiku. Kufa ganzi, kuwasha-washa, kuvimba chini ya bendeji au vidole kuwa bluu humaanisha imebana sana. Bendeji ya krepu iliyofuliwa inaweza kutumika tena mara kadhaa, hivyo familia hununua chache kwa mwaka, ilhali timu za michezo na shule hununua zaidi. Afya inauza upana huu mitatu muhimu kwa bei nafuu ili kuteguka kushughulikiwe siku hiyo hiyo."],["Everyday sports and household injury need; very low cost, reusable and pairs with cold gels.","Hitaji la kila siku la majeraha ya michezo na nyumbani; bei ndogo, inatumika tena na huenda pamoja na jeli za baridi."]],"fh_wnd_cohes":[["A cohesive bandage sticks to itself but not to skin or hair, so it holds a dressing or supports a joint without clips, pins or tape and stays in place during movement. It is popular for sports strapping, securing dressings on fingers and toes, and for children who pull off ordinary bandages. A 5 cm width suits fingers, wrists and small dressings, and it can be cut to length with scissors and torn by hand. Apply with only light stretch, because it keeps tightening slightly as it settles; always check that fingers and toes stay pink and warm. One roll lasts a family several months. Afya stocks it as a modern, easier alternative to crepe for customers who want quick, secure wrapping.","Bendeji inayojinata hunata yenyewe lakini hainati kwenye ngozi wala nywele, hivyo hushikilia bendeji ya kidonda au kusaidia kiungo bila vibanio, pini au tepu na hubaki mahali pake wakati wa kusogea. Inapendwa kwa kufunga viungo michezoni, kushikilia bendeji kwenye vidole vya mikono na miguu, na kwa watoto wanaovuta bendeji za kawaida. Upana wa sentimita 5 unafaa kwa vidole, viganja na bendeji ndogo, na inaweza kukatwa kwa mkasi au kuchanwa kwa mkono. Ifunge kwa kuivuta kidogo tu, kwa sababu huendelea kubana kidogo inapotulia; daima hakikisha vidole vinabaki vya rangi ya waridi na vyenye joto. Mzunguko mmoja hudumu kwa familia miezi kadhaa. Afya inaiuza kama mbadala wa kisasa na rahisi wa krepu kwa wateja wanaotaka kufunga haraka na kwa uhakika."],["Modern, higher-margin upgrade on crepe that sports players and parents of young children quickly adopt.","Uboreshaji wa kisasa wenye faida zaidi kuliko krepu ambao wanamichezo na wazazi wa watoto wadogo huupokea haraka."]],"fh_wnd_tape":[["Medical tape fixes gauze, pads and tubing to the skin. Zinc oxide tape is strong, rigid and cheap, good for holding thick dressings and for strapping fingers and ankles; microporous paper tape is gentler, breathes well and peels off fragile skin of babies and older people with less pain. Choose 2.5 cm for most dressings and a wider roll for larger pads, and avoid putting tape on broken skin or wrapping it all the way round a limb, which can cut off circulation. Remove tape slowly, pressing the skin down as you peel. A roll lasts a family many months, while carers changing daily dressings use one or two a month. Afya stocks both rigid and gentle types so customers can match the tape to the skin.","Tepu ya kitabibu hushikilia gozi, pedi na mipira ya dawa kwenye ngozi. Tepu ya zinc oxide ni imara, haivutiki na ni nafuu, nzuri kwa kushikilia bendeji nene na kufunga vidole na vifundo vya mguu; tepu ya karatasi yenye vitundu vidogo ni laini zaidi, hupitisha hewa vizuri na huondoka kwenye ngozi nyororo ya watoto wachanga na wazee kwa maumivu kidogo. Chagua upana wa sentimita 2.5 kwa bendeji nyingi na mzunguko mpana zaidi kwa pedi kubwa, na epuka kubandika tepu kwenye ngozi iliyochubuka au kuizungusha kuzunguka kiungo chote, kwani inaweza kuzuia damu kutiririka. Ondoa tepu polepole huku ukibonyeza ngozi chini unapoivuta. Mzunguko mmoja hudumu kwa familia miezi mingi, ilhali walezi wanaobadilisha bendeji kila siku hutumia mmoja au miwili kwa mwezi. Afya inauza aina zote mbili, imara na laini, ili wateja walinganishe tepu na aina ya ngozi."],["Cheap, essential companion to every gauze and pad sale with steady clinic and carer demand.","Bidhaa nafuu na muhimu inayoambatana na kila mauzo ya gozi na pedi, yenye mahitaji ya kudumu kutoka kliniki na kwa walezi."]],"fh_wnd_antl":[["Antiseptic liquids such as chloroxylenol (the classic brown liquid) and cetrimide–chlorhexidine (the pale-yellow type) kill germs on skin and are widely used in Tanzanian homes for cleaning cuts, grazes and household linen. They must always be diluted exactly as the label says before touching skin — undiluted liquid can burn — and for a fresh, small wound, running clean water is the most important cleaning step. Keep the bottle high and locked away from children, because these liquids are a common cause of childhood poisoning. Small 50–125 ml bottles suit a first-aid box, while 500–750 ml bottles serve large families, salons and schools. Afya stocks both main types in small and family sizes because they are among the most trusted and requested items in the zone.","Dawa za maji za kuua vijidudu kama chloroxylenol (ile dawa ya rangi ya kahawia inayojulikana) na cetrimide–chlorhexidine (aina ya rangi ya njano hafifu) huua vijidudu kwenye ngozi na hutumika sana katika nyumba za Tanzania kusafisha mikato, michubuko na nguo za nyumbani. Lazima ichanganywe na maji kila mara kama lebo inavyoelekeza kabla ya kugusa ngozi — dawa isiyochanganywa inaweza kuunguza — na kwa kidonda kipya kidogo, maji safi yanayotiririka ndiyo hatua muhimu zaidi ya kusafisha. Weka chupa juu na mahali palipofungwa mbali na watoto, kwa sababu dawa hizi ni chanzo cha kawaida cha sumu kwa watoto. Chupa ndogo za ml 50–125 zinafaa kwa kisanduku cha huduma ya kwanza, ilhali chupa za ml 500–750 zinahudumia familia kubwa, saluni na shule. Afya inauza aina zote mbili kuu kwa saizi ndogo na za familia kwa sababu ni kati ya bidhaa zinazoaminika na kuulizwa zaidi katika eneo hili."],["Household name with near-universal demand; family bottles carry good value and drive repeat visits.","Jina linalojulikana na kila kaya lenye mahitaji karibu kwa wote; chupa za familia zina thamani nzuri na huleta wateja kurudi."]],"fh_wnd_pvi":[["Povidone-iodine 10% solution is a broad-spectrum antiseptic used by clinics to disinfect skin and minor wounds; it stings less than old-style iodine tincture and stains the skin brown so you can see where it has been applied. Tincture of iodine is cheaper but alcohol-based, so it stings and is better for intact skin around a wound than for open wounds. Apply a thin layer with a clean swab after rinsing the wound with clean water, and let it dry before covering. Do not use iodine products on large wounds, on newborns, in pregnancy for prolonged periods, or in people with thyroid disease or iodine allergy unless a health worker advises it. A 100 ml bottle lasts a family many months. Afya stocks a value tincture and the trusted povidone-iodine standard for families who want what the clinic uses.","Povidone-iodine asilimia 10 ni dawa ya kuua vijidudu vya aina nyingi inayotumika kliniki kusafisha ngozi na vidonda vidogo; inauma kidogo kuliko tincture ya iodini ya zamani na hupaka ngozi rangi ya kahawia ili uone ulipopaka. Tincture ya iodini ni nafuu zaidi lakini ina alkoholi, hivyo inauma na inafaa zaidi kwa ngozi nzima inayozunguka kidonda kuliko kwa kidonda kilicho wazi. Paka safu nyembamba kwa gozi safi baada ya kusuuza kidonda kwa maji safi, na iache ikauke kabla ya kufunika. Usitumie bidhaa za iodini kwenye vidonda vikubwa, kwa watoto wachanga, wakati wa ujauzito kwa muda mrefu, au kwa watu wenye ugonjwa wa tezi ya shingo au mzio wa iodini isipokuwa mhudumu wa afya ameshauri. Chupa ya ml 100 hudumu kwa familia miezi mingi. Afya inauza tincture ya bei nafuu na povidone-iodine ya kiwango kinachoaminika kwa familia zinazotaka kile kinachotumika kliniki."],["Clinic-trusted antiseptic with steady demand and a value option for low-budget buyers.","Dawa inayoaminika kliniki yenye mahitaji ya kudumu na chaguo nafuu kwa wanunuzi wa bajeti ndogo."]],"fh_wnd_spirit":[["Surgical spirit and 70% isopropyl alcohol quickly kill germs on intact skin and on small instruments such as thermometers, tweezers, scissors and glucose meters. They should not be poured into open wounds, because alcohol stings and damages healing tissue; use clean water or saline for the wound itself. Seventy per cent alcohol works better than higher strengths because the water helps it penetrate germs. Alcohol is highly flammable: store it away from cookers, candles, mosquito coils and children, and keep the cap closed so it does not evaporate. A 100 ml bottle suits a home kit, 500 ml suits carers, and 5-litre containers suit clinics, salons and businesses refilling their own bottles. Afya stocks all three sizes because alcohol is the everyday disinfectant behind many other first-aid tasks.","Spiriti ya upasuaji na alkoholi ya isopropyl ya asilimia 70 huua vijidudu haraka kwenye ngozi nzima na kwenye vifaa vidogo kama vipimajoto, koleo ndogo, mikasi na mashine za kupima sukari. Hazipaswi kumwagwa ndani ya vidonda vilivyo wazi, kwa sababu alkoholi huuma na huharibu tishu zinazopona; tumia maji safi au maji ya chumvi kwa kidonda chenyewe. Alkoholi ya asilimia sabini hufanya kazi vizuri kuliko viwango vya juu zaidi kwa sababu maji huisaidia kupenya vijidudu. Alkoholi huwaka moto kwa urahisi sana: ihifadhi mbali na majiko, mishumaa, koili za mbu na watoto, na funga kifuniko ili isivukize. Chupa ya ml 100 inafaa kwa kisanduku cha nyumbani, ml 500 kwa walezi, na madumu ya lita 5 kwa kliniki, saluni na biashara zinazojaza chupa zao. Afya inauza saizi zote tatu kwa sababu alkoholi ndiyo dawa ya kila siku ya kuua vijidudu inayohitajika katika kazi nyingi za huduma ya kwanza."],["Cheap, fast-moving staple with a bulk 5-litre option that wins business customers.","Bidhaa ya msingi nafuu inayouzika haraka, yenye chaguo la lita 5 linalovutia wateja wa biashara."]],"fh_wnd_cream":[["Antiseptic creams combine a mild germ-killing ingredient with a soothing base, giving light protection to small cuts and grazes after they have been rinsed, while healing ointments such as dexpanthenol keep the wound moist so new skin forms faster and scars less. Choose an antiseptic cream for everyday scrapes, a healing gel or ointment for slow, dry or cracked wounds, and a zinc-based cream for chafing and nappy soreness. Use a thin layer only, and do not put creams on deep, dirty, bite or burn wounds without advice. A 30–50 g tube lasts a family two to three months. Afya stocks a familiar value cream and premium healing options so families can treat minor injuries properly at home and avoid infected wounds.","Krimu za kuua vijidudu huchanganya kiambato kidogo cha kuua vijidudu na msingi wa kutuliza, hivyo hutoa kinga nyepesi kwa mikato midogo na michubuko baada ya kusuuzwa, wakati mafuta ya kuponya kama dexpanthenol huweka kidonda unyevu ili ngozi mpya iote haraka na kovu liwe dogo. Chagua krimu ya kuua vijidudu kwa michubuko ya kila siku, jeli au mafuta ya kuponya kwa vidonda vinavyopona polepole, vikavu au vilivyopasuka, na krimu yenye zinki kwa kuchubuka kwa msuguano na vidonda vya eneo la nepi. Tumia safu nyembamba tu, na usipake krimu kwenye vidonda virefu, vichafu, vya kuumwa na mnyama au vya kuungua bila ushauri. Tube ya gramu 30–50 hudumu kwa familia miezi miwili hadi mitatu. Afya inauza krimu inayojulikana ya bei nafuu na chaguo bora za kuponya ili familia zitibu majeraha madogo vizuri nyumbani na kuepuka vidonda kuoza."],["Trusted brands with good margins, easy to recommend at the counter with every plaster sale.","Chapa zinazoaminika zenye faida nzuri, rahisi kupendekeza kaunta pamoja na kila mauzo ya plasta."]],"fh_wnd_saline":[["Sterile 0.9% saline has the same salt balance as body fluids, so it rinses dirt and grit from a wound without stinging or damaging healing tissue, and it is what nurses use for most dressing changes. Wound-cleansing sprays put sterile saline or a mild antiseptic in a pressurised can, which makes it easy to flush a child’s knee or a cut on the road where clean water is not available. Use enough to wash the wound until it looks clean, pat the skin dry, then dress it; discard opened bottles of saline after 24 hours. Where neither is available, boiled water cooled in a clean covered container is a good substitute. Afya stocks a value saline bottle and convenient sprays for car and handbag kits.","Maji tasa ya chumvi ya asilimia 0.9 yana uwiano wa chumvi sawa na majimaji ya mwili, hivyo huosha uchafu na mchanga kwenye kidonda bila kuuma wala kuharibu tishu zinazopona, na ndiyo yanayotumiwa na wauguzi katika kubadilisha bendeji nyingi. Dawa za kunyunyiza za kusafisha vidonda huweka maji tasa ya chumvi au dawa nyepesi ya kuua vijidudu ndani ya kopo lenye mgandamizo, hivyo ni rahisi kuosha goti la mtoto au mkato barabarani mahali ambapo hakuna maji safi. Tumia kiasi cha kutosha kuosha kidonda hadi kionekane safi, kausha ngozi kwa kugusa-gusa, kisha funga; tupa chupa ya maji ya chumvi iliyofunguliwa baada ya saa 24. Mahali ambapo hakuna vyote viwili, maji yaliyochemshwa na kupozwa kwenye chombo safi kilichofunikwa ni mbadala mzuri. Afya inauza chupa ya maji ya chumvi ya bei nafuu na dawa za kunyunyiza zinazofaa kwa visanduku vya gari na mkoba."],["Brings clinic-standard wound cleaning into homes; sprays are a premium impulse buy for travel kits.","Huleta usafishaji wa vidonda wa kiwango cha kliniki nyumbani; dawa za kunyunyiza ni ununuzi wa ghafla wa thamani kwa visanduku vya safari."]],"fh_wnd_cotton":[["Absorbent cotton wool is soft, highly absorbent cotton used for applying calamine or antiseptic to intact skin, cleaning around wounds, padding splints and general baby and personal care. It should not be placed directly on an open wound because fibres stick to it; use gauze or a non-adherent pad there instead. Choose a 50–100 g roll for a home kit and a 400 g roll for large families, salons and carers. Keep it dry in its wrapper and take out only what you need with clean hands so the rest stays clean. Afya stocks small and large rolls at value prices because cotton wool is one of the most frequently bought items in every pharmacy basket.","Pamba ya kufyonza ni pamba laini inayofyonza sana, inayotumika kupaka calamine au dawa ya kuua vijidudu kwenye ngozi nzima, kusafisha kuzunguka vidonda, kuweka kinga laini chini ya banzi na huduma ya jumla ya watoto na mwili. Haipaswi kuwekwa moja kwa moja kwenye kidonda kilicho wazi kwa sababu nyuzi zake hunata humo; tumia gozi au pedi isiyonata badala yake. Chagua mzunguko wa gramu 50–100 kwa kisanduku cha nyumbani na mzunguko wa gramu 400 kwa familia kubwa, saluni na walezi. Iweke kavu ndani ya kifungashio chake na utoe kiasi unachohitaji tu kwa mikono safi ili inayobaki ibaki safi. Afya inauza mizunguko midogo na mikubwa kwa bei nafuu kwa sababu pamba ni mojawapo ya bidhaa zinazonunuliwa mara nyingi zaidi katika kila kikapu cha duka la dawa."],["High-frequency, low-price staple that brings shoppers back and sits in every kit.","Bidhaa ya msingi ya bei ndogo inayonunuliwa mara nyingi, huwarudisha wateja na ipo katika kila kisanduku."]],"fh_skin_burngel":[["Burns and scalds from cooking fires, charcoal stoves, kettles and hot porridge are among the most common household injuries in Tanzania, especially for young children. The first and most important treatment is cool running water for 20 minutes, started as soon as possible; a burn gel is used after that to keep the area cool and moist, ease pain and protect the skin. Choose a water-based hydrogel or a burns cream, never butter, oil, toothpaste or raw egg, and cover lightly with a non-adherent pad or cling film. Any burn larger than the palm of the patient’s hand, on the face, hands, feet or genitals, deep or white, or in a baby or elderly person needs a clinic straight away. Afya stocks value and premium burn gels so every kitchen can keep one next to the cooker.","Kuungua kwa moto wa kupikia, majiko ya mkaa, birika na uji wa moto ni kati ya majeraha ya kawaida zaidi nyumbani Tanzania, hasa kwa watoto wadogo. Tiba ya kwanza na muhimu zaidi ni maji baridi yanayotiririka kwa dakika 20, yakianzishwa mapema iwezekanavyo; jeli ya kuungua hutumika baada ya hapo kuweka eneo likiwa baridi na lenye unyevu, kupunguza maumivu na kulinda ngozi. Chagua jeli yenye msingi wa maji au krimu ya kuungua, kamwe si siagi, mafuta, dawa ya meno au yai bichi, na funika kwa wepesi kwa pedi isiyonata au karatasi ya plastiki ya jikoni. Kuungua kokote kukubwa kuliko kiganja cha mgonjwa, usoni, mikononi, miguuni au sehemu za siri, kurefu au kweupe, au kwa mtoto mchanga au mzee kunahitaji kliniki mara moja. Afya inauza jeli za kuungua za bei nafuu na za hali ya juu ili kila jiko liwe na moja karibu na jiko la kupikia."],["Addresses a top household injury, replaces harmful home remedies and is easy to promote with kitchen safety advice.","Hushughulikia jeraha kuu la nyumbani, huchukua nafasi ya tiba hatari za kienyeji na ni rahisi kutangaza pamoja na ushauri wa usalama jikoni."]],"fh_skin_burndr":[["Hydrogel burn dressings are sterile pads soaked in a cooling gel that continue to cool the burn, relieve pain and protect it from dirt and air, which is especially useful when the family must travel to a clinic. Small burn plasters suit finger and hand burns; larger sheet dressings and limb rolls are for bigger burns on the way to care. They do not replace 20 minutes of cool running water, which must come first. Do not burst blisters, and seek care urgently for large, deep, facial, electrical or chemical burns and for any burn in a young child. Keep at least one dressing in the kitchen first-aid box and one in the car kit. Afya stocks them as specialist items because few shops carry them yet they make the biggest difference in the first hour.","Bendeji za jeli za kuungua ni pedi tasa zilizolowekwa kwenye jeli ya kupoza ambazo huendelea kupoza kidonda cha moto, kupunguza maumivu na kukilinda dhidi ya uchafu na hewa, jambo lenye manufaa hasa familia inapolazimika kusafiri kwenda kliniki. Plasta ndogo za kuungua zinafaa kwa kuungua kwa vidole na kiganja; bendeji kubwa za karatasi na mizunguko ya viungo ni kwa kuungua kukubwa njiani kwenda kupata huduma. Hazichukui nafasi ya dakika 20 za maji baridi yanayotiririka, ambayo lazima yaje kwanza. Usipasue malengelenge, na tafuta huduma haraka kwa kuungua kukubwa, kurefu, kwa uso, kwa umeme au kemikali na kwa kuungua kokote kwa mtoto mdogo. Weka angalau bendeji moja kwenye kisanduku cha huduma ya kwanza jikoni na moja kwenye kisanduku cha gari. Afya inaziuza kama bidhaa maalum kwa sababu maduka machache huziuza ilhali huleta tofauti kubwa zaidi katika saa ya kwanza."],["Specialist, higher-value item few competitors stock, ideal for kitchen and car kit upsells.","Bidhaa maalum yenye thamani ya juu ambayo washindani wachache huiuza, nzuri kwa kuongeza mauzo ya visanduku vya jikoni na gari."]],"fh_skin_bite":[["Bite and sting creams contain a soothing antihistamine or cooling ingredient that calms the itch, redness and swelling of insect bites so children scratch less and bites do not become infected sores. Wash the bite with soap and water, remove a bee sting by scraping it sideways with a card, then apply a thin layer up to three times a day for a few days. Do not use on broken skin or large areas, and get emergency help at once for swelling of the lips, tongue or throat, difficulty breathing, or dizziness after a sting. A 20 g tube lasts a family a whole rainy season. Afya stocks it because mosquito and insect bites are part of everyday life in Dar es Salaam, and parents want quick relief that stops scratching.","Krimu za kuumwa na wadudu zina kiambato cha antihistamine cha kutuliza au cha kupoza kinachotuliza muwasho, wekundu na uvimbe wa kuumwa na wadudu ili watoto wajikune kidogo na kuumwa kusigeuke kuwa vidonda vilivyooza. Osha mahali palipoumwa kwa sabuni na maji, ondoa mwiba wa nyuki kwa kuukwangua kwa ubavu kwa kadi, kisha paka safu nyembamba hadi mara tatu kwa siku kwa siku chache. Usitumie kwenye ngozi iliyochubuka au eneo kubwa, na tafuta msaada wa dharura mara moja midomo, ulimi au koo vikivimba, kupumua kwa shida, au kizunguzungu baada ya kuumwa. Tube ya gramu 20 hudumu kwa familia msimu mzima wa mvua. Afya inaiuza kwa sababu kuumwa na mbu na wadudu ni sehemu ya maisha ya kila siku Dar es Salaam, na wazazi wanataka nafuu ya haraka inayozuia kujikuna."],["Year-round need that spikes in the rains; premium pharmacy product with strong margin.","Hitaji la mwaka mzima linaloongezeka wakati wa mvua; bidhaa ya duka la dawa yenye faida kubwa."]],"fh_skin_calam":[["Calamine lotion is a pink suspension of zinc oxide and ferric oxide that cools and dries itchy skin, and it has been a first-line home remedy for heat rash, chickenpox spots, mild sunburn and insect bites for generations. Shake the bottle well, dab it onto the itchy area with cotton wool and let it dry to a thin pink film; repeat several times a day. It is gentle enough for children but should not be used on broken, oozing skin or near the eyes. A 100 ml bottle lasts a family through a bout of chickenpox or a hot season. Afya stocks a very low-cost lotion and a well-known brand because calamine is asked for by name and is one of the most affordable ways to ease itching.","Losheni ya calamine ni mchanganyiko wa rangi ya waridi wa zinc oxide na ferric oxide unaopoza na kukausha ngozi inayowasha, na imekuwa tiba ya kwanza ya nyumbani kwa vipele vya joto, madoa ya tetekuwanga, kuungua kidogo na jua na kuumwa na wadudu kwa vizazi vingi. Tikisa chupa vizuri, paka kwa kugusa-gusa eneo linalowasha kwa pamba na uiache ikauke kuwa safu nyembamba ya waridi; rudia mara kadhaa kwa siku. Ni laini kiasi cha kufaa watoto lakini isitumike kwenye ngozi iliyochubuka, inayotoa majimaji au karibu na macho. Chupa ya ml 100 hudumu kwa familia katika kipindi cha tetekuwanga au msimu wa joto. Afya inauza losheni ya bei nafuu sana na chapa inayojulikana kwa sababu calamine huulizwa kwa jina na ni mojawapo ya njia nafuu zaidi za kupunguza muwasho."],["Asked for by name, extremely affordable and peaks with heat rash in the hot season.","Huulizwa kwa jina, ni nafuu mno na huuzika zaidi wakati wa vipele vya joto msimu wa joto."]],"fh_skin_aloe":[["Aloe vera and after-sun gels cool and moisturise skin that has had too much sun, easing the tightness and sting of mild sunburn on the face, neck, shoulders and arms after beach days, outdoor work or long journeys. Choose a gel with a high aloe content and little or no fragrance or alcohol; keeping it in the fridge makes it more soothing. Sunburn that blisters widely, or comes with fever, chills, headache or vomiting, may be heat illness and needs medical attention; small children with sunburn should always be checked. Aloe gel also soothes skin after shaving and mild heat rash. A 100–200 ml tube lasts several weeks. Afya stocks pure aloe gels and an after-sun gel so families can treat sunburn at home and remember sun protection next time.","Jeli za aloe vera na za baada ya jua hupoza na kulainisha ngozi iliyopata jua kupita kiasi, zikipunguza mkazo na kuuma kwa kuungua kidogo na jua usoni, shingoni, mabegani na mikononi baada ya siku za ufukweni, kazi za nje au safari ndefu. Chagua jeli yenye kiwango kikubwa cha aloe na yenye harufu au alkoholi kidogo au isiyo nayo kabisa; kuiweka kwenye friji huifanya itulize zaidi. Kuungua na jua kunakoleta malengelenge mengi, au kunakoambatana na homa, kutetemeka, kuumwa kichwa au kutapika, kunaweza kuwa ugonjwa wa joto na kunahitaji huduma ya kitabibu; watoto wadogo walioungua na jua wanapaswa kuchunguzwa kila mara. Jeli ya aloe pia hutuliza ngozi baada ya kunyoa na vipele vidogo vya joto. Tube ya ml 100–200 hudumu wiki kadhaa. Afya inauza jeli safi za aloe na jeli ya baada ya jua ili familia zitibu kuungua na jua nyumbani na kukumbuka kujikinga na jua wakati ujao."],["Strong hot-season and holiday seller that cross-sells with sunscreen and hydration products.","Huuzika sana msimu wa joto na sikukuu na huenda pamoja na mafuta ya kujikinga na jua na bidhaa za kunywa maji."]],"fh_pain_partab":[["Paracetamol is the first-choice over-the-counter medicine for fever and mild to moderate pain, including headache, toothache, period pain and body aches, and it is gentle on the stomach and safe in pregnancy at normal doses. The usual adult dose is one or two 500 mg tablets every four to six hours, with no more than eight tablets (4 g) in 24 hours; people who drink alcohol heavily, weigh under 50 kg or have liver disease should take less. Never combine it with other products that also contain paracetamol, such as many cold and flu remedies, because overdose damages the liver silently. In Tanzania, any fever should be tested for malaria — paracetamol eases the fever but does not treat its cause. Afya stocks a value 100-tablet pack, a trusted branded pack and a small pack for the handbag.","Paracetamol ni dawa ya kwanza isiyohitaji cheti cha daktari kwa homa na maumivu madogo hadi ya wastani, ikiwemo kuumwa kichwa, maumivu ya jino, maumivu ya hedhi na maumivu ya mwili, na ni laini kwa tumbo na salama wakati wa ujauzito kwa dozi ya kawaida. Dozi ya kawaida kwa mtu mzima ni kidonge kimoja au viwili vya 500 mg kila saa nne hadi sita, bila kuzidi vidonge vinane (gramu 4) ndani ya saa 24; watu wanaokunywa pombe kwa wingi, wenye uzito chini ya kilo 50 au wenye ugonjwa wa ini wanapaswa kutumia kidogo zaidi. Usiichanganye kamwe na bidhaa nyingine zenye paracetamol, kama dawa nyingi za mafua, kwa sababu kuzidisha dozi huharibu ini kimyakimya. Tanzania, homa yoyote inapaswa kupimwa malaria — paracetamol hupunguza homa lakini haitibu chanzo chake. Afya inauza pakiti ya vidonge 100 ya bei nafuu, pakiti ya chapa inayoaminika na pakiti ndogo ya kubeba kwenye mkoba."],["The single most-bought medicine in Tanzanian homes; drives footfall and every first-aid basket.","Dawa moja inayonunuliwa zaidi katika nyumba za Tanzania; huleta wateja na ipo katika kila kikapu cha huduma ya kwanza."]],"fh_pain_parsol":[["Soluble paracetamol tablets dissolve in a glass of water and are absorbed faster than ordinary tablets, which helps people with a sore throat, older people who struggle to swallow, and anyone who wants quicker relief from fever or headache. The dose and daily maximum are the same as standard paracetamol — two 500 mg tablets, no more than eight in 24 hours — and the same warning applies about not combining it with other paracetamol products. Effervescent tablets contain sodium, so people on a low-salt diet for high blood pressure or kidney disease should prefer ordinary tablets. Keep the tube tightly closed and dry. Afya stocks it as a premium choice alongside standard tablets for customers who value speed and comfort.","Vidonge vya paracetamol vinavyoyeyuka huyeyuka kwenye glasi ya maji na hufyonzwa haraka kuliko vidonge vya kawaida, jambo linalosaidia watu wenye kidonda cha koo, wazee wanaopata shida kumeza, na yeyote anayetaka nafuu ya haraka kutoka kwa homa au kuumwa kichwa. Dozi na kiwango cha juu kwa siku ni sawa na paracetamol ya kawaida — vidonge viwili vya 500 mg, bila kuzidi vinane ndani ya saa 24 — na tahadhari ileile inahusika kuhusu kutoichanganya na bidhaa nyingine za paracetamol. Vidonge vinavyofura vina sodiamu, hivyo watu walio kwenye lishe ya chumvi kidogo kwa sababu ya shinikizo la damu au ugonjwa wa figo wanapaswa kupendelea vidonge vya kawaida. Funga kifungashio vizuri na kiweke mahali pakavu. Afya inaiuza kama chaguo la hali ya juu pamoja na vidonge vya kawaida kwa wateja wanaothamini kasi na urahisi."],["Premium trade-up on the most-bought medicine with clear benefit for the elderly and sore throats.","Uboreshaji wa bei ya juu wa dawa inayonunuliwa zaidi, wenye faida dhahiri kwa wazee na wenye vidonda vya koo."]],"fh_pain_parsyr":[["Children’s paracetamol suspension (120 mg in 5 ml for infants and young children) is the safest first medicine for fever and pain after vaccinations, teething or a cold. Dose by the child’s age and, better, weight, using the syringe or spoon in the pack — never a kitchen spoon — and leave at least four hours between doses, with no more than four doses in 24 hours. Babies under three months with a fever of 38°C or higher, and any child with fever who is very sleepy, has a stiff neck, a rash that does not fade, fast breathing or fits, must be seen urgently; in Tanzania every child with fever should be tested for malaria. Sugar-free versions are kinder to teeth for frequent use. Afya stocks a value syrup, a trusted brand and a sugar-free infant option, each kept with dosing guidance at the counter.","Sharubati ya paracetamol ya watoto (mg 120 kwa ml 5 kwa watoto wachanga na wadogo) ndiyo dawa ya kwanza salama zaidi kwa homa na maumivu baada ya chanjo, kuota meno au mafua. Pima dozi kulingana na umri wa mtoto na, bora zaidi, uzito wake, ukitumia bomba au kijiko kilichomo kwenye pakiti — kamwe si kijiko cha jikoni — na acha angalau saa nne kati ya dozi, bila kuzidi dozi nne ndani ya saa 24. Watoto chini ya miezi mitatu wenye homa ya nyuzi 38°C au zaidi, na mtoto yeyote mwenye homa aliye na usingizi mzito sana, shingo ngumu, vipele visivyofifia, kupumua haraka au degedege, lazima aonwe haraka; Tanzania kila mtoto mwenye homa anapaswa kupimwa malaria. Aina zisizo na sukari ni bora kwa meno kwa matumizi ya mara kwa mara. Afya inauza sharubati ya bei nafuu, chapa inayoaminika na chaguo lisilo na sukari kwa watoto wachanga, kila moja ikiambatana na mwongozo wa dozi kaunta."],["Essential for every family with young children; strong trust builder and repeat purchase.","Muhimu kwa kila familia yenye watoto wadogo; hujenga imani kubwa na hununuliwa mara kwa mara."]],"fh_pain_ibu":[["Ibuprofen is an anti-inflammatory painkiller that works especially well for pain with swelling, such as sprains, back and joint pain, toothache and period cramps, and it also lowers fever. The usual adult over-the-counter dose is one or two 200 mg tablets three times a day with food, no more than six 200 mg tablets in 24 hours, for up to three days for fever or ten days for pain without advice. Avoid it if you have a stomach ulcer, asthma that worsens with painkillers, kidney or heart disease, are in the last three months of pregnancy, or take blood thinners — paracetamol is safer in those cases. Liquid capsules act faster but cost more. Afya stocks a value 200 mg capsule, a well-known tablet and a fast liquid capsule so customers can choose by budget.","Ibuprofen ni dawa ya maumivu inayopunguza uvimbe ambayo hufanya kazi vizuri hasa kwa maumivu yenye uvimbe, kama kuteguka, maumivu ya mgongo na viungo, maumivu ya jino na maumivu ya tumbo wakati wa hedhi, na pia hushusha homa. Dozi ya kawaida kwa mtu mzima bila cheti ni kidonge kimoja au viwili vya 200 mg mara tatu kwa siku pamoja na chakula, bila kuzidi vidonge sita vya 200 mg ndani ya saa 24, kwa hadi siku tatu kwa homa au siku kumi kwa maumivu bila ushauri. Iepuke ikiwa una kidonda cha tumbo, pumu inayozidi kwa dawa za maumivu, ugonjwa wa figo au moyo, uko katika miezi mitatu ya mwisho ya ujauzito, au unatumia dawa za kupunguza kuganda kwa damu — paracetamol ni salama zaidi katika hali hizo. Kapsuli za majimaji hufanya kazi haraka zaidi lakini ni ghali zaidi. Afya inauza kapsuli ya 200 mg ya bei nafuu, kidonge kinachojulikana na kapsuli ya majimaji ya haraka ili wateja wachague kulingana na bajeti."],["Second most-requested painkiller; branded fast-acting options add margin over generics.","Dawa ya maumivu inayoombwa zaidi ya pili; chaguo za chapa zinazofanya kazi haraka huongeza faida kuliko za kawaida."]],"fh_pain_ibusyr":[["Children’s ibuprofen suspension (100 mg in 5 ml) treats fever, teething pain, earache and pain with swelling in children aged three months and over who weigh more than 5 kg. It lasts six to eight hours and should be given with or after food, using the syringe in the pack and following the dose for the child’s age, with no more than three doses in 24 hours. Do not give it to children who are dehydrated (for example with diarrhoea and vomiting), have asthma that worsens with ibuprofen, or have chickenpox. Use one medicine at a time, and only alternate with paracetamol if a health worker advises it. Any fever in Tanzania should be checked for malaria. Afya stocks it as the second-line option parents ask for when paracetamol alone is not enough.","Sharubati ya ibuprofen ya watoto (mg 100 kwa ml 5) hutibu homa, maumivu ya kuota meno, maumivu ya sikio na maumivu yenye uvimbe kwa watoto wa miezi mitatu na zaidi wenye uzito wa zaidi ya kilo 5. Hudumu saa sita hadi nane na inapaswa kutolewa pamoja na chakula au baada ya kula, ukitumia bomba lililomo kwenye pakiti na kufuata dozi ya umri wa mtoto, bila kuzidi dozi tatu ndani ya saa 24. Usimpe mtoto aliyepungukiwa na maji mwilini (kwa mfano mwenye kuharisha na kutapika), mwenye pumu inayozidi kwa ibuprofen, au mwenye tetekuwanga. Tumia dawa moja kwa wakati mmoja, na badilisha na paracetamol pale tu mhudumu wa afya ameshauri. Homa yoyote Tanzania inapaswa kupimwa malaria. Afya inaiuza kama chaguo la pili ambalo wazazi huomba pale paracetamol peke yake haitoshi."],["Completes the children’s fever range; premium imported brand with good margin.","Hukamilisha bidhaa za homa za watoto; chapa ya kuagizwa yenye faida nzuri."]],"fh_pain_rub":[["Topical pain products are rubbed into the skin over sore muscles and joints. Warming rubs with methyl salicylate and menthol ease stiffness and long-standing aches such as backache from carrying loads or long hours in a daladala, while cooling gels with menthol give quick relief to fresh sprains, knocks and sports injuries in the first two days. Apply a thin layer up to three or four times a day, wash hands afterwards, and never use on broken skin, near the eyes or under a tight bandage or heat pack. Salicylate rubs are not for children under 12, people allergic to aspirin, or during pregnancy. A tube lasts several weeks of regular use. Afya stocks warming and cooling options in small and larger sizes because muscle pain is one of the commonest reasons adults walk into a pharmacy.","Bidhaa za kupaka za maumivu husuguliwa kwenye ngozi juu ya misuli na viungo vinavyouma. Dawa za kupaka za joto zenye methyl salicylate na menthol hupunguza ukakamavu na maumivu ya muda mrefu kama maumivu ya mgongo kutokana na kubeba mizigo au saa nyingi ndani ya daladala, wakati jeli za baridi zenye menthol hutoa nafuu ya haraka kwa kuteguka kupya, kugongwa na majeraha ya michezo katika siku mbili za kwanza. Paka safu nyembamba hadi mara tatu au nne kwa siku, nawa mikono baadaye, na kamwe usipake kwenye ngozi iliyochubuka, karibu na macho au chini ya bendeji iliyobana au mfuko wa joto. Dawa za salicylate si kwa watoto chini ya miaka 12, watu wenye mzio wa aspirini, au wakati wa ujauzito. Tube moja hudumu wiki kadhaa za matumizi ya kawaida. Afya inauza chaguo za joto na baridi kwa saizi ndogo na kubwa kwa sababu maumivu ya misuli ni moja ya sababu za kawaida zaidi watu wazima kuingia duka la dawa."],["Everyday adult need with strong brand recognition and frequent repeat purchase.","Hitaji la kila siku la watu wazima lenye chapa zinazojulikana sana na ununuzi wa mara kwa mara."]],"fh_pain_patch":[["Self-heating patches contain iron powder that warms up when exposed to air and stick to clothing or skin to give gentle, steady heat for up to eight hours. Heat relaxes muscles and is well proven for period cramps and stiff lower backs, and a patch lets the user carry on working, studying or travelling without a hot-water bottle. Stick it on underwear or a vest rather than directly on skin if the label says so, do not sleep with it on, and do not use it on numb skin, broken skin, or with rubs and creams, because burns can result. People with diabetes or poor circulation should check their skin often. Afya stocks single patches as an affordable, discreet impulse buy next to the period-care and pain counter.","Plasta zinazojipasha joto zina unga wa chuma unaopata joto unapogusana na hewa na hunata kwenye nguo au ngozi kutoa joto laini na la kudumu kwa hadi saa nane. Joto hulegeza misuli na limethibitishwa vizuri kwa maumivu ya tumbo wakati wa hedhi na kiuno kilichokakamaa, na plasta humwezesha mtumiaji kuendelea kufanya kazi, kusoma au kusafiri bila chupa ya maji ya moto. Ibandike kwenye nguo ya ndani au fulana badala ya moja kwa moja kwenye ngozi ikiwa lebo inaelekeza hivyo, usilale ukiwa umeivaa, na usiitumie kwenye ngozi iliyokufa ganzi, ngozi iliyochubuka, au pamoja na dawa za kupaka na krimu, kwa sababu inaweza kusababisha kuungua. Watu wenye kisukari au mzunguko hafifu wa damu wanapaswa kuangalia ngozi yao mara kwa mara. Afya inauza plasta moja moja kama ununuzi wa ghafla nafuu na wa siri karibu na kaunta ya huduma ya hedhi na maumivu."],["Discreet, drug-free relief that women buy monthly; easy impulse add-on.","Nafuu isiyo na dawa na ya siri ambayo wanawake hununua kila mwezi; rahisi kuongeza kwa ghafla."]],"fh_pain_therm":[["A thermometer turns “feeling hot” into a number, which helps decide when to give medicine, when to test for malaria and when to go to a clinic. Digital stick thermometers are cheap and accurate under the arm or in the mouth and give a reading in about a minute; non-contact infrared thermometers read the forehead in a second without waking a sleeping child, but should be held at the right distance and used away from fans and direct sun. A temperature of 37.5–38°C or above is a fever; in a baby under three months, 38°C or more needs a clinic the same day. Clean the tip with alcohol between users and replace the battery when the display fades. Afya stocks registered pharmacy-grade models at value, mid and premium levels, because every home should own one.","Kipimajoto hubadilisha “kuhisi joto” kuwa namba, jambo linalosaidia kuamua wakati wa kutoa dawa, wakati wa kupima malaria na wakati wa kwenda kliniki. Vipimajoto vya kidijitali vya kijiti ni nafuu na sahihi vikiwekwa kwapani au mdomoni na hutoa jibu ndani ya takriban dakika moja; vipimajoto vya mionzi visivyogusa hupima paji la uso kwa sekunde moja bila kumwamsha mtoto aliyelala, lakini vinapaswa kushikwa kwa umbali sahihi na kutumika mbali na feni na jua moja kwa moja. Joto la nyuzi 37.5–38°C au zaidi ni homa; kwa mtoto chini ya miezi mitatu, 38°C au zaidi linahitaji kliniki siku hiyo hiyo. Safisha ncha kwa alkoholi kati ya watumiaji na badilisha betri skrini ikififia. Afya inauza aina zilizosajiliwa za kiwango cha duka la dawa kwa bei nafuu, ya kati na ya juu, kwa sababu kila nyumba inapaswa kuwa na kimoja."],["Device every household should own; supports malaria-testing advice and has strong gift and kit upsell.","Kifaa ambacho kila kaya inapaswa kuwa nacho; huunga mkono ushauri wa kupima malaria na huongeza mauzo ya zawadi na visanduku."]],"fh_pain_hcp":[["A reusable gel pack can be cooled in the freezer for fresh injuries or warmed in hot water for stiff muscles and period pain, replacing ice cubes in a towel or a hot-water bottle. Use cold in the first 48 hours after a sprain, knock or bruise to reduce swelling, for 15–20 minutes at a time every two to three hours; use warmth for long-standing stiffness and muscle spasms. Always wrap the pack in a cloth, never place it directly on skin, and check the skin regularly in children, older people and anyone with diabetes. A good pack lasts years if it is not punctured. Afya stocks two durable models because they are a one-time purchase that pays back with every sports injury and backache in the family.","Mfuko wa jeli unaotumika tena unaweza kupozwa kwenye friza kwa majeraha mapya au kupashwa moto kwa maji ya moto kwa misuli iliyokakamaa na maumivu ya hedhi, ukichukua nafasi ya vipande vya barafu ndani ya taulo au chupa ya maji ya moto. Tumia baridi katika saa 48 za kwanza baada ya kuteguka, kugongwa au mchubuko wa ndani ili kupunguza uvimbe, kwa dakika 15–20 kila baada ya saa mbili hadi tatu; tumia joto kwa ukakamavu wa muda mrefu na mikazo ya misuli. Daima funga mfuko kwa kitambaa, kamwe usiuweke moja kwa moja kwenye ngozi, na angalia ngozi mara kwa mara kwa watoto, wazee na yeyote mwenye kisukari. Mfuko mzuri hudumu miaka kama hautatobolewa. Afya inauza aina mbili imara kwa sababu ni ununuzi wa mara moja unaolipa kila mara familia inapopata jeraha la michezo au maumivu ya mgongo."],["Durable, higher-ticket first-aid upgrade that sports families and schools value.","Uboreshaji wa huduma ya kwanza wa kudumu na bei ya juu kidogo unaothaminiwa na familia za wanamichezo na shule."]],"fh_cold_loz":[["Throat lozenges dissolve slowly in the mouth, coating the throat and keeping it moist; medicated lozenges add a mild antiseptic or anaesthetic, while menthol drops give a cooling feel and ease a blocked nose. Most sore throats are caused by viruses and get better within a week; lozenges ease the discomfort but do not shorten the illness. Adults can usually take one every two to three hours, with no more than about eight to twelve a day depending on the product; they are not suitable for children under six because of choking risk. See a health worker for a sore throat with high fever, difficulty swallowing or breathing, white patches with swollen neck glands, or one lasting more than a week. Afya stocks single pocket packs, everyday menthol drops and a premium medicated lozenge.","Pipi za koo huyeyuka polepole mdomoni, zikifunika koo na kuliweka na unyevu; pipi zenye dawa huongeza dawa nyepesi ya kuua vijidudu au ya kutuliza maumivu, wakati pipi za menthol hutoa hisia ya baridi na kupunguza pua iliyoziba. Vidonda vingi vya koo husababishwa na virusi na hupona ndani ya wiki moja; pipi hupunguza usumbufu lakini hazifupishi ugonjwa. Watu wazima kwa kawaida wanaweza kutumia moja kila baada ya saa mbili hadi tatu, bila kuzidi takriban nane hadi kumi na mbili kwa siku kulingana na bidhaa; hazifai kwa watoto chini ya miaka sita kwa sababu ya hatari ya kukwama kooni. Muone mhudumu wa afya kwa kidonda cha koo chenye homa kali, shida ya kumeza au kupumua, madoa meupe pamoja na tezi za shingo zilizovimba, au kinachodumu zaidi ya wiki moja. Afya inauza pakiti ndogo za mfukoni, pipi za menthol za kila siku na pipi za dawa za hali ya juu."],["Cheap impulse item at the till that peaks every cold season and drives repeat visits.","Bidhaa nafuu ya ghafla kaunta inayouzika sana kila msimu wa baridi na huleta wateja kurudi."]],"fh_cold_vrub":[["Vapour rubs contain camphor, menthol and eucalyptus oil in a petroleum base; rubbed on the chest and back, they release aromatic vapours that make breathing feel easier and help people with a cold sleep. Use a thin layer on the chest, throat and back up to three times a day, cover with warm clothing, and keep it away from the nose, eyes, mouth and broken skin. Never use vapour rubs on babies under two years, never heat them in a microwave or hot water, and never put them inside the nostrils. Camphor is poisonous if swallowed, so store the jar high and closed. A 25 g jar lasts a season for one person and a 50 g jar suits a family. Afya stocks both sizes because the vapour rub is one of the most familiar cold remedies in Tanzanian homes.","Mafuta ya mvuke yana camphor, menthol na mafuta ya mkaratusi katika msingi wa mafuta ya petroli; yakipakwa kifuani na mgongoni, hutoa mvuke wenye harufu nzuri unaofanya kupumua kuhisi rahisi zaidi na kusaidia watu wenye mafua kulala. Paka safu nyembamba kifuani, kooni na mgongoni hadi mara tatu kwa siku, funika kwa nguo za joto, na yaweke mbali na pua, macho, mdomo na ngozi iliyochubuka. Kamwe usitumie mafuta ya mvuke kwa watoto chini ya miaka miwili, kamwe usiyapashe moto kwenye microwave au maji ya moto, na kamwe usiyaweke ndani ya matundu ya pua. Camphor ni sumu ikimezwa, hivyo weka chupa juu na ikiwa imefungwa. Chupa ya gramu 25 hudumu msimu mmoja kwa mtu mmoja na ya gramu 50 inafaa familia. Afya inauza saizi zote mbili kwa sababu mafuta ya mvuke ni mojawapo ya tiba za mafua zinazojulikana zaidi katika nyumba za Tanzania."],["Iconic, asked-for-by-name cold remedy with reliable seasonal peaks.","Tiba maarufu ya mafua inayoulizwa kwa jina, yenye vipindi vya mauzo ya juu vya uhakika kila msimu."]],"fh_cold_inh":[["A nasal inhaler stick contains menthol, camphor and other aromatic oils on a wick inside a small tube; sniffing it gives a cool sensation that makes a blocked nose feel clearer during a cold, travel or dusty weather. Hold one nostril closed and breathe in gently through the other two or three times, as often as needed, and keep the cap tightly closed so it lasts. It is for personal use only — do not share it — and is not suitable for children under six. Each stick lasts about two to three months once opened. Afya stocks it as a low-cost, pocket-sized impulse product that customers pick up with lozenges and tissues.","Kijiti cha kuvuta cha pua kina menthol, camphor na mafuta mengine yenye harufu kwenye utambi ndani ya mrija mdogo; kukinusa hutoa hisia ya baridi inayofanya pua iliyoziba kuhisi wazi zaidi wakati wa mafua, safari au hali ya hewa yenye vumbi. Ziba tundu moja la pua na vuta pumzi kwa upole kupitia lingine mara mbili au tatu, kila unapohitaji, na funga kifuniko vizuri ili kidumu. Ni kwa matumizi binafsi tu — usikiazime mtu mwingine — na hakifai kwa watoto chini ya miaka sita. Kila kijiti hudumu takriban miezi miwili hadi mitatu baada ya kufunguliwa. Afya inakiuza kama bidhaa nafuu ya mfukoni ya ghafla ambayo wateja huchukua pamoja na pipi za koo na tishu."],["Small, cheap, pocket-sized add-on that sells steadily to commuters and travellers.","Bidhaa ndogo, nafuu ya mfukoni ya kuongeza inayouzika kwa uthabiti kwa wasafiri na wanaosafiri kila siku kwenda kazini."]],"fh_cold_nsal":[["Saline nasal sprays and drops are sterile salt water that loosens mucus, washes out dust and pollen and makes a blocked nose easier to clear, without any medicine — so they are safe for newborns, pregnant and breastfeeding women and long-term use. For babies, put one or two drops in each nostril a few minutes before feeds and gently remove the loosened mucus with a nasal aspirator; for adults and older children, spray into each nostril several times a day. Unlike decongestant sprays, saline does not cause rebound blockage. Each bottle should be used by one person only and discarded after the time stated on the label once opened. Afya stocks a children’s spray and one with a baby aspirator, because a clear nose is the key to feeding and sleeping during a cold.","Dawa za pua za maji ya chumvi ni maji tasa yenye chumvi yanayolainisha kamasi, kuosha vumbi na chavua na kufanya pua iliyoziba iwe rahisi kusafishwa, bila dawa yoyote — hivyo ni salama kwa watoto wachanga, wanawake wajawazito na wanaonyonyesha na kwa matumizi ya muda mrefu. Kwa watoto wachanga, weka tone moja au mawili katika kila tundu la pua dakika chache kabla ya kunyonyesha na ondoa kwa upole kamasi iliyolainishwa kwa kifaa cha kuvuta kamasi; kwa watu wazima na watoto wakubwa, nyunyiza katika kila tundu la pua mara kadhaa kwa siku. Tofauti na dawa za kufungua pua zenye kemikali, maji ya chumvi hayasababishi pua kuziba tena zaidi. Kila chupa inapaswa kutumiwa na mtu mmoja tu na kutupwa baada ya muda ulioandikwa kwenye lebo tangu kufunguliwa. Afya inauza dawa ya kunyunyiza ya watoto na nyingine yenye kifaa cha kuvuta kamasi cha mtoto, kwa sababu pua safi ndiyo ufunguo wa kunyonya na kulala wakati wa mafua."],["Drug-free remedy that parents and pregnant women trust; premium imported products with good margin.","Tiba isiyo na dawa ambayo wazazi na wajawazito wanaiamini; bidhaa za kuagizwa zenye faida nzuri."]],"fh_cold_cough":[["Expectorant cough syrups containing guaifenesin thin the mucus in the chest so it is easier to cough up, and they suit the wet, chesty cough that often follows a cold. Choose a syrup that matches the cough — expectorant for a chesty cough, a soothing glycerol syrup for a dry tickly one — and avoid combining several cough and cold products, which may duplicate ingredients. Drink plenty of warm fluids; honey in warm water is a proven home remedy for children over one year. Cough medicines are not recommended for children under six, and should be used in children aged six to twelve only on a pharmacist’s advice. A cough lasting more than three weeks, coughing blood, weight loss, night sweats or breathlessness needs a clinic and a tuberculosis check. Afya stocks two trusted expectorant syrups including a sugar-free option.","Dawa za kikohozi za kutoa makohozi zenye guaifenesin hulainisha kamasi kifuani ili iwe rahisi kukohoa na kuitoa, na zinafaa kwa kikohozi chenye majimaji na makohozi kinachofuata mafua mara nyingi. Chagua dawa inayolingana na kikohozi — ya kutoa makohozi kwa kikohozi cha kifua, sharubati ya glycerol ya kutuliza kwa kikohozi kikavu cha kuwasha — na epuka kuchanganya bidhaa kadhaa za kikohozi na mafua, ambazo zinaweza kurudia viambato vilevile. Kunywa vinywaji vya moto kwa wingi; asali katika maji ya uvuguvugu ni tiba ya nyumbani iliyothibitishwa kwa watoto zaidi ya mwaka mmoja. Dawa za kikohozi hazipendekezwi kwa watoto chini ya miaka sita, na zinapaswa kutumika kwa watoto wa miaka sita hadi kumi na mbili kwa ushauri wa mfamasia tu. Kikohozi kinachodumu zaidi ya wiki tatu, kukohoa damu, kupungua uzito, kutokwa jasho usiku au kushindwa kupumua kunahitaji kliniki na kupimwa kifua kikuu. Afya inauza dawa mbili za kutoa makohozi zinazoaminika, ikiwemo chaguo lisilo na sukari."],["Top seasonal seller with premium branded margin; strong counter-advice opportunity.","Inauzika sana kwa msimu na faida ya chapa za hali ya juu; fursa nzuri ya kutoa ushauri kaunta."]],"fh_cold_combo":[["Cold and flu remedies combine a painkiller such as paracetamol with a decongestant, and sometimes an antihistamine, to ease fever, aches, headache and a blocked or runny nose in one dose; hot-drink sachets add comfort and fluids. Because most contain paracetamol, never take them with other paracetamol products, and stay within the daily limit on the pack. Decongestants are not suitable for people with high blood pressure, heart disease, an overactive thyroid, glaucoma or prostate problems, or in pregnancy, and night-time products that cause drowsiness must not be taken before driving. They relieve symptoms only; in Tanzania, fever with chills and body pain should first be tested for malaria. Afya stocks a value local tablet, a trusted branded tablet and a premium hot-drink sachet.","Dawa za mafua huchanganya dawa ya maumivu kama paracetamol na dawa ya kufungua pua, na wakati mwingine antihistamine, ili kupunguza homa, maumivu ya mwili, kuumwa kichwa na pua iliyoziba au inayotiririka kwa dozi moja; sacheti za kinywaji cha moto huongeza faraja na maji mwilini. Kwa kuwa nyingi zina paracetamol, kamwe usizitumie pamoja na bidhaa nyingine za paracetamol, na usizidi kiwango cha siku kilichoandikwa kwenye pakiti. Dawa za kufungua pua hazifai kwa watu wenye shinikizo la damu la juu, ugonjwa wa moyo, tezi ya shingo inayofanya kazi kupita kiasi, glaucoma au matatizo ya tezi dume, au wakati wa ujauzito, na bidhaa za usiku zinazoleta usingizi zisitumiwe kabla ya kuendesha gari. Zinapunguza dalili tu; Tanzania, homa yenye kutetemeka na maumivu ya mwili inapaswa kupimwa malaria kwanza. Afya inauza kidonge cha bei nafuu, kidonge cha chapa inayoaminika na sacheti ya kinywaji cha moto ya hali ya juu."],["One of the busiest cold-season lines; a clear value-to-premium ladder suits every budget.","Mojawapo ya bidhaa zenye shughuli nyingi msimu wa baridi; ngazi ya bei kutoka nafuu hadi ya juu inafaa kila bajeti."]],"fh_cold_anti":[["Antihistamines block the body’s allergy chemical and relieve hay fever symptoms from dust, pollen and pets, as well as itchy rashes and insect-bite reactions. Non-drowsy cetirizine taken once a day suits adults who need to work, study or drive, while chlorphenamine syrup acts quickly but causes drowsiness and is usually used at night or for short periods, never in babies under the age stated on the pack. Avoid alcohol with antihistamines, and check with a pharmacist in pregnancy, breastfeeding, epilepsy, glaucoma or prostate problems. Swelling of the lips, tongue or face, wheezing or difficulty breathing is an emergency that needs immediate medical help, not tablets at home. Afya stocks a non-drowsy tablet and a classic syrup to cover adults and children.","Dawa za antihistamine huzuia kemikali ya mzio mwilini na hupunguza dalili za mzio wa vumbi, chavua na wanyama, pamoja na vipele vinavyowasha na athari za kuumwa na wadudu. Cetirizine isiyoleta usingizi inayotumiwa mara moja kwa siku inafaa watu wazima wanaohitaji kufanya kazi, kusoma au kuendesha gari, wakati sharubati ya chlorphenamine hufanya kazi haraka lakini huleta usingizi na kwa kawaida hutumika usiku au kwa muda mfupi, kamwe si kwa watoto wachanga chini ya umri ulioandikwa kwenye pakiti. Epuka pombe unapotumia antihistamine, na wasiliana na mfamasia wakati wa ujauzito, kunyonyesha, kifafa, glaucoma au matatizo ya tezi dume. Kuvimba kwa midomo, ulimi au uso, kupumua kwa mluzi au kushindwa kupumua ni dharura inayohitaji msaada wa kitabibu mara moja, si vidonge nyumbani. Afya inauza kidonge kisicholeta usingizi na sharubati ya kawaida ili kuhudumia watu wazima na watoto."],["Year-round allergy demand with dusty dry-season peaks; repeat buyers once relief is found.","Mahitaji ya mzio mwaka mzima yanayoongezeka wakati wa ukavu wenye vumbi; wanunuzi hurudi wakipata nafuu."]],"fh_cold_tiss":[["Disposable pocket tissues are the most hygienic way to blow a runny nose and to catch coughs and sneezes, because each one is used once and thrown away, unlike cloth handkerchiefs that carry germs back into a pocket or onto hands. Teach children to cough or sneeze into a tissue or their elbow, bin the tissue straight away and then wash or sanitise their hands — a simple habit that reduces the spread of colds, flu and other respiratory infections at home and school. Soft three-ply tissues are kinder to a sore nose during a heavy cold. A person with a cold uses one or two packs a day, while families keep a few packs in bags and the car. Afya stocks very low-cost packs, including its own label, as an essential till-side item.","Tishu za mfukoni za kutupa ndiyo njia safi zaidi ya kupenga pua inayotiririka na kuziba vikohozi na chafya, kwa sababu kila moja hutumika mara moja na kutupwa, tofauti na leso za kitambaa zinazorudisha vijidudu mfukoni au mikononi. Wafundishe watoto kukohoa au kupiga chafya ndani ya tishu au kiwiko chao, kutupa tishu mara moja kisha kunawa au kutakasa mikono — tabia rahisi inayopunguza kuenea kwa mafua, homa ya mafua na maambukizi mengine ya njia ya hewa nyumbani na shuleni. Tishu laini za tabaka tatu ni laini zaidi kwa pua inayouma wakati wa mafua makali. Mtu mwenye mafua hutumia pakiti moja au mbili kwa siku, ilhali familia huweka pakiti chache kwenye mikoba na gari. Afya inauza pakiti za bei nafuu sana, zikiwemo za chapa yake, kama bidhaa muhimu karibu na kaunta ya malipo."],["Ultra-cheap impulse buy at the till and a showcase for Afya own-label quality.","Ununuzi wa ghafla wa bei nafuu mno kaunta na mfano wa ubora wa bidhaa za chapa ya Afya."]],"fh_cold_tea":[["Warm drinks are one of the simplest ways to soothe a sore throat, loosen a blocked nose and keep up fluids during a cold, and ginger tea is a familiar, caffeine-light choice in many Tanzanian homes. Ginger may also ease mild nausea, including travel sickness, and adding a spoon of honey helps cough in adults and children over one year (never give honey to babies under twelve months). Choose plain ginger, ginger-lemon or herbal blends without added sugar; people taking blood thinners or with gallstones should not use large amounts of ginger. One box of 20–100 bags lasts a family through a cold season. Afya stocks a value local ginger tea and premium herbal infusions to offer comfort beyond medicine.","Vinywaji vya moto ni mojawapo ya njia rahisi zaidi za kutuliza koo linalouma, kulegeza pua iliyoziba na kudumisha maji mwilini wakati wa mafua, na chai ya tangawizi ni chaguo linalojulikana lenye kafeini kidogo katika nyumba nyingi za Tanzania. Tangawizi pia inaweza kupunguza kichefuchefu kidogo, ikiwemo kichefuchefu cha safari, na kuongeza kijiko cha asali husaidia kikohozi kwa watu wazima na watoto zaidi ya mwaka mmoja (kamwe usiwape asali watoto chini ya miezi kumi na mbili). Chagua tangawizi tupu, tangawizi na limau au mchanganyiko wa mitishamba bila sukari iliyoongezwa; watu wanaotumia dawa za kupunguza kuganda kwa damu au wenye mawe ya nyongo wasitumie tangawizi kwa wingi. Boksi moja la mifuko 20–100 hudumu kwa familia msimu mzima wa baridi. Afya inauza chai ya tangawizi ya bei nafuu ya hapa nchini na chai za mitishamba za hali ya juu kutoa faraja zaidi ya dawa."],["Food-category add-on that lifts cold-season baskets and suits Afya Box comfort bundles.","Bidhaa ya chakula ya kuongeza inayoongeza vikapu vya msimu wa baridi na inafaa vifurushi vya faraja vya Afya Box."]],"fh_stom_ors":[["Oral rehydration salts are a precise mix of glucose and salts that, dissolved in clean water, replace the fluid and minerals lost through diarrhoea and vomiting; low-osmolarity ORS is the WHO-recommended formula and has saved millions of children’s lives. Mix one sachet in exactly the volume of clean, cooled boiled water stated on the pack — usually one litre — and never add sugar or use less water. Give small, frequent sips, continue breastfeeding and normal food, and make a fresh solution every 24 hours. Children with diarrhoea should also receive zinc for 10–14 days. Seek care urgently for blood in the stool, inability to drink, repeated vomiting, sunken eyes, very little urine or a floppy, sleepy child. Afya stocks single sachets at the lowest possible price so every home can keep several.","Chumvi za kurejesha maji mwilini ni mchanganyiko sahihi wa glukosi na chumvi ambao, ukiyeyushwa katika maji safi, hurudisha maji na madini yaliyopotea kwa kuharisha na kutapika; ORS yenye osmolarity ya chini ndiyo fomula inayopendekezwa na WHO na imeokoa maisha ya mamilioni ya watoto. Changanya sacheti moja katika kiasi kamili cha maji safi yaliyochemshwa na kupozwa kilichoandikwa kwenye pakiti — kwa kawaida lita moja — na kamwe usiongeze sukari wala kutumia maji kidogo. Mpe mgonjwa mafunda madogo mara kwa mara, endelea kunyonyesha na chakula cha kawaida, na tengeneza mchanganyiko mpya kila baada ya saa 24. Watoto wanaoharisha wanapaswa pia kupewa zinki kwa siku 10–14. Tafuta huduma haraka kwa damu kwenye kinyesi, kushindwa kunywa, kutapika mara kwa mara, macho kuingia ndani, mkojo kidogo sana au mtoto aliyelegea na mwenye usingizi. Afya inauza sacheti moja moja kwa bei ya chini kabisa iwezekanavyo ili kila nyumba iweze kuweka kadhaa."],["Life-saving essential with year-round demand that peaks in the rains; builds trust as a low-price anchor.","Bidhaa muhimu ya kuokoa maisha yenye mahitaji ya mwaka mzima yanayoongezeka wakati wa mvua; hujenga imani kama bidhaa ya bei ya chini."]],"fh_stom_orsz":[["WHO and the Tanzanian Ministry of Health recommend that every child with diarrhoea receive both ORS and zinc: ORS prevents dehydration, while zinc shortens the illness, makes it less severe and lowers the chance of another bout in the following months. Dispersible zinc tablets dissolve in a teaspoon of breast milk, ORS or clean water — 10 mg a day for babies under six months and 20 mg a day for older children — and must be continued for the full 10–14 days even after the diarrhoea stops. Co-packs keep the right number of ORS sachets and zinc tablets together, which makes the full course easier to follow. Afya stocks both the co-pack and separate zinc tablets at very low prices because this pairing is one of the most effective child-health tools available in any pharmacy.","WHO na Wizara ya Afya ya Tanzania zinapendekeza kila mtoto anayeharisha apewe ORS na zinki kwa pamoja: ORS huzuia upungufu wa maji mwilini, wakati zinki hufupisha ugonjwa, hupunguza ukali wake na hupunguza uwezekano wa kuharisha tena katika miezi inayofuata. Vidonge vya zinki vinavyoyeyuka huyeyuka katika kijiko kidogo cha maziwa ya mama, ORS au maji safi — mg 10 kwa siku kwa watoto chini ya miezi sita na mg 20 kwa siku kwa watoto wakubwa — na lazima viendelee kwa siku 10–14 kamili hata baada ya kuharisha kukoma. Pakiti za pamoja huweka idadi sahihi ya sacheti za ORS na vidonge vya zinki pamoja, jambo linalorahisisha kufuata dozi kamili. Afya inauza pakiti ya pamoja na vidonge vya zinki peke yake kwa bei ya chini sana kwa sababu muunganiko huu ni mojawapo ya zana bora zaidi za afya ya mtoto zinazopatikana katika duka lolote la dawa."],["Evidence-based child-health essential that positions Afya as a trusted family pharmacy.","Bidhaa muhimu ya afya ya mtoto yenye ushahidi wa kisayansi inayoiweka Afya kama duka la dawa la familia linaloaminika."]],"fh_stom_antliq":[["Alginate-antacid liquids neutralise stomach acid and form a soothing raft on top of the stomach contents that stops acid rising into the food pipe, giving fast relief from heartburn and reflux, including after large, spicy or late meals and during Ramadan iftar. Many alginate liquids are suitable in pregnancy, when heartburn is very common, but check the pack and ask the pharmacist. Take 10–20 ml after meals and at bedtime, and avoid taking other medicines within two hours because antacids can reduce their absorption. Heartburn that is new after age 55, comes with weight loss, difficulty swallowing, vomiting blood or black stools, or needs treatment most days for more than three weeks should be seen by a doctor. Afya stocks a value twin-pack and a stronger advanced liquid.","Dawa za maji za alginate na antacid huondoa nguvu ya asidi ya tumbo na kutengeneza tabaka la kutuliza juu ya chakula tumboni linalozuia asidi kupanda kwenye umio, hivyo hutoa nafuu ya haraka kwa kiungulia na asidi kurudi kooni, ikiwemo baada ya milo mikubwa, yenye pilipili au ya usiku na wakati wa futari ya Ramadhani. Dawa nyingi za alginate zinafaa wakati wa ujauzito, ambapo kiungulia ni cha kawaida sana, lakini angalia pakiti na muulize mfamasia. Kunywa ml 10–20 baada ya milo na wakati wa kulala, na epuka kumeza dawa nyingine ndani ya saa mbili kwa sababu antacid zinaweza kupunguza ufyonzwaji wake. Kiungulia kilichoanza baada ya miaka 55, kinachoambatana na kupungua uzito, shida ya kumeza, kutapika damu au kinyesi cheusi, au kinachohitaji matibabu karibu kila siku kwa zaidi ya wiki tatu kinapaswa kuonwa na daktari. Afya inauza pakiti ya chupa mbili ya bei nafuu na dawa yenye nguvu zaidi."],["Strong demand around Ramadan and pregnancy; premium branded margin.","Mahitaji makubwa wakati wa Ramadhani na ujauzito; faida ya chapa za hali ya juu."]],"fh_stom_antfz":[["Effervescent fruit-salt sachets and chewable antacid tablets neutralise excess stomach acid within minutes and are easy to carry in a pocket or handbag for occasional heartburn, bloating or indigestion after a heavy meal. Fruit salts are stirred into a glass of water and drunk while fizzing; chewable tablets are chewed thoroughly after meals. Effervescent sachets contain a lot of sodium, so people with high blood pressure, heart failure or kidney disease and those on a low-salt diet should choose a low-sodium chewable instead. Do not use antacids every day for more than two weeks without advice, and leave two hours between antacids and other medicines. Afya stocks single sachets for a few shillings, a 10-sachet box and a branded chewable for regular sufferers.","Sacheti za chumvi ya matunda zinazofura na vidonge vya kutafuna vya kiungulia huondoa nguvu ya asidi ya ziada tumboni ndani ya dakika chache na ni rahisi kubeba mfukoni au kwenye mkoba kwa kiungulia, kujaa gesi au kuvimbiwa kwa mara moja moja baada ya mlo mzito. Chumvi ya matunda hukorogwa kwenye glasi ya maji na kunywewa ikiwa bado inafura; vidonge vya kutafuna hutafunwa vizuri baada ya milo. Sacheti zinazofura zina sodiamu nyingi, hivyo watu wenye shinikizo la damu la juu, moyo kushindwa kufanya kazi vizuri au ugonjwa wa figo na walio kwenye lishe ya chumvi kidogo wanapaswa kuchagua kidonge cha kutafuna chenye sodiamu kidogo. Usitumie dawa za kiungulia kila siku kwa zaidi ya wiki mbili bila ushauri, na acha saa mbili kati ya dawa ya kiungulia na dawa nyingine. Afya inauza sacheti moja kwa shilingi chache, boksi la sacheti 10 na kidonge cha kutafuna cha chapa kwa wanaopata tatizo mara kwa mara."],["Very low entry price and high frequency, especially after festive and iftar meals.","Bei ya kuanzia ya chini sana na ununuzi wa mara kwa mara, hasa baada ya milo ya sikukuu na futari."]],"fh_stom_probio":[["Probiotics are live beneficial microbes; spore-based products such as Bacillus clausii survive stomach acid and are widely used by doctors in East Africa to help restore gut balance during and after diarrhoea and courses of antibiotics. Single-dose vials or capsules are taken once or twice a day, swallowed directly or mixed with water, milk or juice — never with hot drinks — and should be spaced a few hours apart from antibiotic doses. Probiotics support recovery but never replace ORS and zinc in a child with diarrhoea, and people with a weakened immune system should ask a doctor first. Store vials below 25°C out of direct sun. Afya stocks a well-established probiotic because customers often ask for one after a hospital visit.","Probiotiki ni vijidudu hai vyenye manufaa; bidhaa zenye mbegu kama Bacillus clausii huvumilia asidi ya tumbo na hutumiwa sana na madaktari Afrika Mashariki kusaidia kurejesha uwiano wa utumbo wakati na baada ya kuharisha na matibabu ya antibiotiki. Chupa ndogo za dozi moja au kapsuli humezwa mara moja au mbili kwa siku, moja kwa moja au zikichanganywa na maji, maziwa au juisi — kamwe si na vinywaji vya moto — na zinapaswa kutengwa kwa saa chache na dozi za antibiotiki. Probiotiki husaidia kupona lakini kamwe hazichukui nafasi ya ORS na zinki kwa mtoto anayeharisha, na watu wenye kinga dhaifu ya mwili wanapaswa kumuuliza daktari kwanza. Hifadhi chupa ndogo chini ya nyuzi 25°C mbali na jua moja kwa moja. Afya inauza probiotiki inayojulikana kwa muda mrefu kwa sababu wateja mara nyingi huiomba baada ya kutoka hospitali."],["High-value repeat purchase recommended by clinicians; strong margin per pack.","Ununuzi wa thamani ya juu unaorudiwa unaopendekezwa na wataalamu wa afya; faida kubwa kwa kila pakiti."]],"fh_mal_net":[["Sleeping every night under a long-lasting insecticidal net (LLIN) is the single most effective way for a household to prevent malaria, because the net is both a barrier and an insecticide that kills mosquitoes that land on it. Choose a WHO-prequalified treated net in a size that tucks fully under the mattress — family size for double beds — and a round or rectangular untreated net only where a treated one is not available. Hang it before dusk, tuck it in all round, repair holes promptly, and wash it gently no more than every three months in cool water with plain soap, drying it in the shade. Replace a treated net about every three years. Pregnant women and children under five are at greatest risk and should always sleep under a net. Afya stocks treated and untreated nets so every bed in the home can be covered.","Kulala kila usiku chini ya chandarua chenye dawa ya muda mrefu (LLIN) ndiyo njia moja yenye ufanisi zaidi kwa kaya kuzuia malaria, kwa sababu chandarua ni kizuizi na pia dawa inayoua mbu wanaotua juu yake. Chagua chandarua chenye dawa kilichoidhinishwa na WHO cha saizi inayoweza kuchomekwa chini ya godoro pande zote — saizi ya familia kwa vitanda vya watu wawili — na chandarua cha mviringo au cha mstatili kisicho na dawa pale tu ambapo chenye dawa hakipatikani. Kitundike kabla ya giza, kichomeke pande zote, ziba matundu haraka, na kifue kwa upole si zaidi ya kila miezi mitatu kwa maji baridi na sabuni ya kawaida, ukikianika kivulini. Badilisha chandarua chenye dawa takriban kila miaka mitatu. Wanawake wajawazito na watoto chini ya miaka mitano wako katika hatari kubwa zaidi na wanapaswa kulala chini ya chandarua kila mara. Afya inauza vyandarua vyenye dawa na visivyo na dawa ili kila kitanda nyumbani kifunikwe."],["Core malaria-prevention product with bulky, visible display value and strong rainy-season demand.","Bidhaa kuu ya kuzuia malaria yenye mvuto mkubwa wa maonyesho na mahitaji makubwa wakati wa mvua."]],"fh_mal_rplot":[["Skin repellents protect exposed skin when people are outside the net — cooking in the evening, at the mosque, church or a wedding, on night shifts or travelling — which is when many malaria mosquitoes bite. Choose a product with a proven active ingredient such as DEET, picaridin (icaridin) or oil of lemon eucalyptus, and apply a thin, even layer to all exposed skin, reapplying as the label says, especially after sweating or washing. Apply sunscreen first if using both. For children, adults should put repellent on their own hands and then spread it on the child, avoiding the eyes, mouth and hands; check the minimum age on each product. Repellents add to, but never replace, a net at night. Afya stocks value, mid and premium lotions and roll-ons for the whole family.","Dawa za kupaka za kufukuza mbu hulinda ngozi iliyo wazi watu wakiwa nje ya chandarua — wakipika jioni, msikitini, kanisani au harusini, katika zamu za usiku au wakisafiri — ambapo ndipo mbu wengi wa malaria huuma. Chagua bidhaa yenye kiambato kilichothibitishwa kama DEET, picaridin (icaridin) au mafuta ya mkaratusi wa limau, na paka safu nyembamba iliyosawazika kwenye ngozi yote iliyo wazi, ukirudia kama lebo inavyoelekeza, hasa baada ya kutokwa jasho au kunawa. Paka mafuta ya kujikinga na jua kwanza ikiwa unatumia vyote viwili. Kwa watoto, mtu mzima apake dawa kwenye mikono yake kwanza kisha ampake mtoto, akiepuka macho, mdomo na mikono; angalia umri wa chini kwenye kila bidhaa. Dawa za kufukuza mbu huongeza kinga, lakini kamwe hazichukui nafasi ya chandarua usiku. Afya inauza losheni na roll-on za bei nafuu, ya kati na ya juu kwa familia nzima."],["Repeat consumable bought monthly by many families, with peaks in both rainy seasons.","Bidhaa ya matumizi inayonunuliwa kila mwezi na familia nyingi, yenye vipindi vya mauzo ya juu katika misimu yote miwili ya mvua."]],"fh_mal_rpspr":[["Repellent sprays cover large areas of skin and clothing quickly and evenly, which suits adults heading out in the evening, outdoor workers and travellers. Spray from about 15–20 cm onto exposed skin and the outside of clothes, never under clothing, then spread with the hands; for the face, spray onto the hands first and apply, avoiding eyes and mouth. Do not spray near food, open flames or children’s faces, and wash treated skin with soap and water at the end of the day. Pump sprays are preferable to aerosols for indoor use and flights. A 100–120 ml bottle lasts one adult several weeks of evening use. Afya stocks a trusted spray to sit alongside lotions so customers can choose the format they will actually use every day.","Dawa za kunyunyiza za kufukuza mbu hufunika maeneo makubwa ya ngozi na nguo haraka na kwa usawa, jambo linalowafaa watu wazima wanaotoka jioni, wanaofanya kazi nje na wasafiri. Nyunyiza kutoka umbali wa takriban sentimita 15–20 kwenye ngozi iliyo wazi na sehemu ya nje ya nguo, kamwe si chini ya nguo, kisha sambaza kwa mikono; kwa uso, nyunyiza kwenye mikono kwanza kisha upake, ukiepuka macho na mdomo. Usinyunyize karibu na chakula, moto ulio wazi au nyuso za watoto, na osha ngozi iliyopakwa kwa sabuni na maji mwisho wa siku. Chupa za kubonyeza zinapendekezwa zaidi ya za gesi kwa matumizi ya ndani na safari za ndege. Chupa ya ml 100–120 hudumu kwa mtu mzima mmoja wiki kadhaa za matumizi ya jioni. Afya inauza dawa ya kunyunyiza inayoaminika pamoja na losheni ili wateja wachague aina watakayoitumia kweli kila siku."],["Convenient premium format that captures adult and traveller spend.","Aina rahisi ya hali ya juu inayovutia matumizi ya watu wazima na wasafiri."]],"fh_mal_coil":[["Mosquito coils slowly burn a spiral of insecticide-treated paste, releasing a smoke that repels and knocks down mosquitoes for six to eight hours, and they are the lowest-cost area protection for verandas, outdoor kitchens and evening gatherings. Always use them in open or well-ventilated spaces, on the metal stand provided and on a non-flammable surface, away from curtains, bedding, children and pets; never burn a coil inside a closed bedroom while sleeping, because the smoke irritates the lungs, especially for children and people with asthma. One coil lasts an evening, so a box of ten lasts a family about ten days. Coils complement, but do not replace, sleeping under a net. Afya stocks two value brands because coils are the everyday choice of many low-income households.","Koili za mbu huungua polepole mzunguko wa kibandiko chenye dawa ya wadudu, zikitoa moshi unaofukuza na kuangusha mbu kwa saa sita hadi nane, na ndizo kinga ya eneo yenye gharama ya chini zaidi kwa veranda, majiko ya nje na mikusanyiko ya jioni. Daima zitumie katika maeneo ya wazi au yenye hewa ya kutosha, juu ya kishikio cha chuma kilichotolewa na kwenye sehemu isiyoshika moto, mbali na mapazia, matandiko, watoto na wanyama; kamwe usichome koili ndani ya chumba cha kulala kilichofungwa ukiwa umelala, kwa sababu moshi huwasha mapafu, hasa kwa watoto na watu wenye pumu. Koili moja hudumu jioni moja, hivyo boksi la kumi hudumu kwa familia takriban siku kumi. Koili huongeza kinga ya chandarua, lakini haziichukui nafasi yake. Afya inauza chapa mbili za bei nafuu kwa sababu koili ndizo chaguo la kila siku la kaya nyingi zenye kipato cha chini."],["Ultra-low price, very high frequency purchase that keeps households coming back weekly.","Bei ya chini mno na ununuzi wa mara nyingi sana unaowarudisha wateja kila wiki."]],"fh_mal_vap":[["Plug-in vaporisers gently heat a liquid or mat containing insecticide, releasing an odourless vapour that keeps mosquitoes away from a room for up to eight hours a night without smoke or flame. They are a cleaner alternative to coils indoors, suited to bedrooms of families with children or people with asthma, provided the room has some ventilation. Plug the unit straight into the wall, upright, away from curtains, bedding and children’s reach, and switch it on about 30 minutes before bedtime; one liquid refill typically lasts 30–45 nights. Buy the refill that matches your unit, and use vaporisers with, not instead of, a bed net. Afya stocks starter units and refills so customers return each month for the consumable.","Mashine za kuchomeka kwenye umeme hupasha moto kwa upole kimiminika au kipande chenye dawa ya wadudu, zikitoa mvuke usio na harufu unaowaweka mbu mbali na chumba kwa hadi saa nane kwa usiku bila moshi wala moto. Ni mbadala safi zaidi wa koili ndani ya nyumba, zinazofaa vyumba vya kulala vya familia zenye watoto au watu wenye pumu, ilimradi chumba kina hewa kiasi. Chomeka kifaa moja kwa moja ukutani kikiwa kimesimama wima, mbali na mapazia, matandiko na mahali watoto wanapofikia, na kiwashe takriban dakika 30 kabla ya kulala; kijazo kimoja cha kimiminika kwa kawaida hudumu usiku 30–45. Nunua kijazo kinacholingana na kifaa chako, na tumia mashine hizi pamoja na chandarua, si badala yake. Afya inauza vifaa vya kuanzia na vijazo ili wateja warudi kila mwezi kununua kijazo."],["Razor-and-blade model: one device sale creates a monthly refill customer.","Mfumo wa kifaa na kijazo: mauzo ya kifaa kimoja huleta mteja wa kijazo kila mwezi."]],"fh_mal_spray":[["Mosquito aerosols release a fine mist of fast-acting insecticide that kills mosquitoes resting in a room, and they are widely used in Dar es Salaam to clear bedrooms in the evening. Close windows, spray for a few seconds towards corners, under beds and behind curtains, then leave the room closed for 15–20 minutes and air it before anyone sleeps there. Never spray onto people, pets, food, utensils or babies’ cots, keep the can away from flames and heat, and store it out of children’s reach. Aerosols give short-term relief only and do not stop new mosquitoes coming in later at night, so they work best together with a treated net and window screens. Afya stocks a locally popular brand in two sizes at value prices.","Dawa za gesi za mbu hutoa ukungu mwembamba wa dawa ya wadudu inayofanya kazi haraka na kuua mbu waliopumzika chumbani, na hutumika sana Dar es Salaam kusafisha vyumba vya kulala jioni. Funga madirisha, nyunyiza kwa sekunde chache kuelekea pembe, chini ya vitanda na nyuma ya mapazia, kisha acha chumba kimefungwa kwa dakika 15–20 na kifungulie hewa kabla mtu yeyote hajalala humo. Kamwe usinyunyize kwa watu, wanyama, chakula, vyombo au vitanda vya watoto wachanga, weka kopo mbali na moto na joto, na lihifadhi mahali watoto hawafikii. Dawa za gesi hutoa nafuu ya muda mfupi tu na hazizuii mbu wapya kuingia baadaye usiku, hivyo hufanya kazi vizuri zaidi pamoja na chandarua chenye dawa na wavu wa madirisha. Afya inauza chapa maarufu ya hapa nchini kwa saizi mbili kwa bei nafuu."],["Familiar local brand with high rotation, especially in the long and short rains.","Chapa ya hapa nchini inayojulikana yenye mzunguko mkubwa wa mauzo, hasa wakati wa masika na vuli."]],"fh_wat_liq":[["Liquid sodium hypochlorite water treatment kills the bacteria and viruses that cause cholera, typhoid and diarrhoea, and it is the cheapest way to make household drinking water safe — a small bottle treats around 1,000 litres. Add the dose on the label (typically one capful to 20 litres) to clear water in a clean, covered container, stir, and wait at least 30 minutes before drinking; if the water is cloudy, let it settle or filter it through a clean cloth first and use a double dose. The water should have a slight chlorine smell, which shows it is protected. Keep treated water covered and pour it out, rather than dipping cups in. Afya stocks local and Kenyan brands at very low prices, especially for the rainy season and cholera alerts.","Klorini ya maji (sodium hypochlorite) ya kutibu maji huua bakteria na virusi vinavyosababisha kipindupindu, homa ya matumbo na kuharisha, na ndiyo njia nafuu zaidi ya kufanya maji ya kunywa ya nyumbani kuwa salama — chupa ndogo hutibu takriban lita 1,000. Ongeza dozi iliyoandikwa kwenye lebo (kwa kawaida kifuniko kimoja kwa lita 20) kwenye maji maangavu ndani ya chombo safi kilichofunikwa, koroga, na subiri angalau dakika 30 kabla ya kunywa; maji yakiwa na tope, yaache yatulie au yachuje kwa kitambaa safi kwanza na utumie dozi mara mbili. Maji yanapaswa kuwa na harufu kidogo ya klorini, inayoonyesha yamelindwa. Funika maji yaliyotibiwa na yamimine badala ya kuchota kwa vikombe. Afya inauza chapa za hapa nchini na za Kenya kwa bei ya chini sana, hasa msimu wa mvua na wakati wa tahadhari za kipindupindu."],["Public-health essential at a tiny price, with sharp demand spikes during rains and outbreaks.","Bidhaa muhimu ya afya ya jamii kwa bei ndogo sana, yenye mahitaji yanayopanda ghafla wakati wa mvua na milipuko."]],"fh_wat_tab":[["Chlorine-releasing tablets such as sodium dichloroisocyanurate (NaDCC) are a compact, long-lasting way to disinfect drinking water: one 67 mg tablet treats about 20 litres, so a strip fits in a pocket for travel, school trips and power or water-supply cuts. Drop the correct number of tablets into clear water in a clean container, close it and wait 30 minutes before drinking; filter or settle cloudy water first. Tablets have a shelf life of several years when kept dry, which makes them ideal for emergency kits and flood season. They do not remove dirt or chemicals, so a filter is better for visibly dirty water. Afya stocks a WHO-recognised tablet as the dependable backup to liquid chlorine.","Vidonge vinavyotoa klorini kama sodium dichloroisocyanurate (NaDCC) ni njia ndogo na ya kudumu ya kuua vijidudu kwenye maji ya kunywa: kidonge kimoja cha mg 67 hutibu takriban lita 20, hivyo kipande kimoja cha vidonge hutoshea mfukoni kwa safari, ziara za shule na wakati umeme au maji yamekatika. Weka idadi sahihi ya vidonge kwenye maji maangavu ndani ya chombo safi, funga na subiri dakika 30 kabla ya kunywa; chuja au tuliza maji yenye tope kwanza. Vidonge hudumu miaka kadhaa vikihifadhiwa pakavu, jambo linalovifanya vifae kwa visanduku vya dharura na msimu wa mafuriko. Haviondoi uchafu wala kemikali, hivyo kichujio ni bora zaidi kwa maji yanayoonekana machafu. Afya inauza kidonge kinachotambuliwa na WHO kama kinga mbadala ya uhakika kwa klorini ya maji."],["Compact, long shelf-life emergency product with demand from travellers, schools and NGOs.","Bidhaa ndogo ya dharura inayodumu muda mrefu, yenye mahitaji kutoka kwa wasafiri, shule na mashirika."]],"fh_wat_flt":[["Gravity water filters pass water slowly through ceramic and carbon cartridges in a two-chamber container with a tap, removing dirt, most bacteria and many tastes and odours, and giving the family clear drinking water without the fuel cost of boiling. Choose a filter with a ceramic candle rated to remove bacteria and a capacity that matches daily drinking needs — about two litres per person per day. Clean the ceramic candle gently with a soft brush when the flow slows, replace cartridges as the maker advises, and keep the upper chamber covered. For extra safety during cholera alerts, chlorinate the water as well. A filter is a one-off investment that pays back quickly against bottled water. Afya stocks two models as specialist, high-value items with replacement cartridges ordered on demand.","Vichujio vya maji vya mvutano hupitisha maji polepole kupitia katriji za udongo wa kauri na kaboni ndani ya chombo cha sehemu mbili chenye bomba, vikiondoa uchafu, bakteria wengi na ladha na harufu nyingi, na kuipa familia maji maangavu ya kunywa bila gharama ya kuni au gesi ya kuchemsha. Chagua kichujio chenye mshumaa wa kauri uliothibitishwa kuondoa bakteria na ujazo unaolingana na mahitaji ya kunywa ya kila siku — takriban lita mbili kwa mtu kwa siku. Safisha mshumaa wa kauri kwa upole kwa brashi laini maji yanapopungua kasi, badilisha katriji kama mtengenezaji anavyoshauri, na weka sehemu ya juu imefunikwa. Kwa usalama zaidi wakati wa tahadhari za kipindupindu, tibu maji kwa klorini pia. Kichujio ni uwekezaji wa mara moja unaorudisha gharama haraka ukilinganisha na maji ya chupa. Afya inauza aina mbili kama bidhaa maalum zenye thamani kubwa, na katriji mbadala huagizwa kwa ombi."],["High-ticket, long-term purchase with replacement-cartridge follow-on sales and gifting appeal.","Ununuzi wa bei kubwa wa muda mrefu wenye mauzo ya katriji mbadala na mvuto wa zawadi."]],"fh_wat_bott":[["A personal reusable bottle filled with safe water from home is the easiest way to keep children and adults drinking enough in Dar es Salaam’s heat, and it avoids the cost and risk of unsafe water bought on the street. Choose a BPA-free bottle with a leak-proof lid, a wide mouth that a brush can reach for cleaning, and a size of about 500–850 ml for school or work. Wash it daily with hot soapy water, dry it open, and replace it if it cracks or the seal smells. Children need roughly 1–1.5 litres of fluid a day and more in the hot season or when active. Afya stocks value and premium bottles to support its safe-water and school-season ranges.","Chupa binafsi ya kutumia tena iliyojazwa maji salama kutoka nyumbani ndiyo njia rahisi zaidi ya kuwafanya watoto na watu wazima wanywe maji ya kutosha katika joto la Dar es Salaam, na huepusha gharama na hatari ya maji yasiyo salama yanayonunuliwa mitaani. Chagua chupa isiyo na BPA yenye kifuniko kisichovuja, mdomo mpana ambao brashi inaweza kuufikia kwa kusafisha, na ujazo wa takriban ml 500–850 kwa shule au kazi. Ioshe kila siku kwa maji ya moto yenye sabuni, iache ikauke ikiwa wazi, na ibadilishe ikipasuka au mpira wa kifuniko ukitoa harufu. Watoto wanahitaji takriban lita 1–1.5 za vinywaji kwa siku na zaidi msimu wa joto au wanapokuwa na shughuli nyingi. Afya inauza chupa za bei nafuu na za hali ya juu kuunga mkono bidhaa zake za maji salama na za msimu wa shule."],["School-term and hot-season seller with gifting appeal and a natural link to water treatment.","Huuzika msimu wa shule na joto, ina mvuto wa zawadi na uhusiano wa moja kwa moja na kutibu maji."]],"fh_hyg_bleach":[["Household bleach (sodium hypochlorite) is the most effective low-cost disinfectant for homes, killing bacteria and viruses including those that cause cholera and diarrhoea on toilets, floors, sinks and cleaning cloths. Always dilute it as the label says — commonly about one part bleach to forty or fifty parts water for general disinfection — in cold water, and use it on surfaces that have already been cleaned of visible dirt. Never mix bleach with toilet cleaners, vinegar, ammonia or other products, because toxic gas is released; wear gloves, keep windows open, and store it in its original bottle locked away from children. Bleach also whitens and sanitises cotton linen and nappies. Afya stocks local and imported brands in 750 ml and family sizes because bleach is the backbone of home hygiene.","Bleach ya nyumbani (sodium hypochlorite) ndiyo dawa ya bei nafuu yenye ufanisi zaidi ya kuua vijidudu majumbani, ikiua bakteria na virusi wakiwemo wanaosababisha kipindupindu na kuharisha kwenye vyoo, sakafu, sinki na vitambaa vya kusafishia. Daima ichanganye kama lebo inavyoelekeza — kwa kawaida takriban sehemu moja ya bleach kwa sehemu arobaini au hamsini za maji kwa kuua vijidudu kwa jumla — katika maji baridi, na itumie kwenye nyuso ambazo tayari zimesafishwa uchafu unaoonekana. Kamwe usichanganye bleach na dawa za vyoo, siki, amonia au bidhaa nyingine, kwa sababu gesi yenye sumu hutoka; vaa glavu, fungua madirisha, na ihifadhi katika chupa yake halisi mahali palipofungwa mbali na watoto. Bleach pia hung’arisha na kuua vijidudu kwenye nguo za pamba na nepi. Afya inauza chapa za hapa nchini na za kuagizwa kwa saizi za ml 750 na za familia kwa sababu bleach ndiyo uti wa mgongo wa usafi wa nyumbani."],["Everyday essential bought by nearly every home, with high rotation and outbreak-driven spikes.","Bidhaa muhimu ya kila siku inayonunuliwa na karibu kila nyumba, yenye mzunguko mkubwa na ongezeko wakati wa milipuko."]],"fh_hyg_pine":[["Pine-type household disinfectants are concentrated liquids that turn milky when diluted and are widely used in Tanzanian homes, schools and businesses to mop floors, wash drains and latrines and leave a fresh scent. Dilute exactly as the label says in a bucket of water, clean visible dirt first, and leave the solution on the surface for a few minutes so it can work. They are not a substitute for bleach where diarrhoea or cholera is present, and they must never be used undiluted on skin or mixed with other cleaners. The 5-litre container is the most economical for large households, guest houses and small businesses. Afya stocks a local brand in 1-litre and 5-litre sizes at value prices.","Dawa za kuua vijidudu za aina ya pine ni vimiminika vilivyokolea vinavyogeuka rangi ya maziwa vinapochanganywa na maji, na hutumika sana katika nyumba, shule na biashara za Tanzania kupiga deki sakafu, kuosha mitaro na vyoo na kuacha harufu nzuri. Changanya kama lebo inavyoelekeza katika ndoo ya maji, safisha uchafu unaoonekana kwanza, na acha mchanganyiko juu ya uso kwa dakika chache ili ufanye kazi. Si mbadala wa bleach pale ambapo kuna kuharisha au kipindupindu, na kamwe zisitumike bila kuchanganywa kwenye ngozi au kuchanganywa na sabuni nyingine. Dumu la lita 5 ndilo lenye gharama nafuu zaidi kwa kaya kubwa, nyumba za wageni na biashara ndogo. Afya inauza chapa ya hapa nchini kwa saizi za lita 1 na lita 5 kwa bei nafuu."],["Locally made, very affordable bulk product that wins guest houses, schools and salons.","Bidhaa ya hapa nchini, nafuu sana kwa wingi, inayovutia nyumba za wageni, shule na saluni."]],"fh_hyg_apc":[["All-purpose cleaners lift grease, food residue and everyday dirt from kitchen counters, tables, tiles and appliances, and some also contain a disinfectant. Cleaning comes before disinfection: removing dirt is what makes disinfectants work, and for most surfaces a good cleaner used daily is enough. Dilute concentrates as directed, wipe with a clean cloth and rinse surfaces that touch food. Plant-based cleaners suit families who want fewer harsh chemicals, while antibacterial multi-action cleaners suit kitchens and homes with someone unwell. Wash and dry cleaning cloths daily, because damp cloths spread germs. Afya stocks value, mid and premium cleaners, including eco options, so every budget is covered.","Sabuni za kusafisha nyuso zote huondoa mafuta, mabaki ya chakula na uchafu wa kila siku kwenye kaunta za jikoni, meza, vigae na vifaa vya nyumbani, na baadhi pia zina dawa ya kuua vijidudu. Usafishaji huja kabla ya kuua vijidudu: kuondoa uchafu ndiko kunakofanya dawa za kuua vijidudu zifanye kazi, na kwa nyuso nyingi sabuni nzuri inayotumika kila siku inatosha. Changanya sabuni zilizokolea kama ilivyoelekezwa, futa kwa kitambaa safi na suuza nyuso zinazogusa chakula. Sabuni zinazotokana na mimea zinafaa familia zinazotaka kemikali kali chache, wakati sabuni za kuua bakteria za matumizi mengi zinafaa majiko na nyumba zenye mgonjwa. Osha na kausha vitambaa vya kusafishia kila siku, kwa sababu vitambaa vyenye unyevu husambaza vijidudu. Afya inauza sabuni za bei nafuu, ya kati na ya juu, zikiwemo za kirafiki kwa mazingira, ili kila bajeti ihudumiwe."],["Weekly household repurchase with a broad price ladder and eco premium options.","Hununuliwa tena kila wiki na kaya, ikiwa na ngazi pana ya bei na chaguo za kirafiki kwa mazingira za bei ya juu."]],"fh_hyg_spray":[["Ready-to-use disinfectant sprays let families quickly treat high-touch surfaces such as door handles, light switches, taps, phones and kitchen tops, especially when someone at home has diarrhoea, flu or another infection. Spray onto a surface that has been wiped clean, leave it wet for the contact time stated on the label — often one to five minutes — then wipe; rinse food-contact surfaces with clean water afterwards if the label says so. Do not spray near food, onto skin or towards children and pets, and never mix with bleach. A 500–750 ml spray lasts a family several weeks. Afya stocks value and branded sprays as the convenient partner to bleach and all-purpose cleaners.","Dawa za kunyunyiza tayari za kuua vijidudu huziwezesha familia kutibu haraka nyuso zinazoguswa mara kwa mara kama vishikio vya milango, swichi za taa, mabomba, simu na kaunta za jikoni, hasa mtu nyumbani anapoharisha, ana mafua au maambukizi mengine. Nyunyiza kwenye uso uliofutwa ukawa safi, uache ukiwa na unyevu kwa muda wa kugusana ulioandikwa kwenye lebo — mara nyingi dakika moja hadi tano — kisha ufute; suuza nyuso zinazogusa chakula kwa maji safi baadaye ikiwa lebo inaelekeza hivyo. Usinyunyize karibu na chakula, kwenye ngozi au kuelekea watoto na wanyama, na kamwe usichanganye na bleach. Chupa ya ml 500–750 hudumu kwa familia wiki kadhaa. Afya inauza dawa za bei nafuu na za chapa kama mwenzi rahisi wa bleach na sabuni za nyuso zote."],["Convenience format with healthy margin and strong demand whenever illness is in the home.","Aina rahisi yenye faida nzuri na mahitaji makubwa kila wakati ugonjwa unapokuwa nyumbani."]],"fh_hyg_floor":[["Floor cleaners are diluted in a bucket of water to mop tiled, terrazzo and cement floors, lifting dust, mud and spills while leaving a fresh smell; antibacterial versions add a disinfectant for homes with crawling babies, pets or someone unwell. During the rains, when mud is tracked indoors, daily mopping keeps germs and hookworm-carrying soil out of living areas. Sweep first, mop with the dilution on the label, change the water when it becomes dirty, and let floors dry before children play on them. Rinse mops and dry them in the sun. A 900 ml–1 litre bottle lasts a family about a month. Afya stocks a branded antibacterial cleaner and a strong eco concentrate to suit different homes.","Sabuni za sakafu huchanganywa katika ndoo ya maji kupiga deki sakafu za vigae, terazo na saruji, zikiondoa vumbi, tope na vitu vilivyomwagika na kuacha harufu nzuri; aina za kuua bakteria huongeza dawa ya kuua vijidudu kwa nyumba zenye watoto wanaotambaa, wanyama au mgonjwa. Wakati wa mvua, tope linapoingizwa ndani, kupiga deki kila siku huzuia vijidudu na udongo wenye minyoo kuingia sehemu za kuishi. Fagia kwanza, piga deki kwa kiasi cha kuchanganya kilichoandikwa kwenye lebo, badilisha maji yanapochafuka, na acha sakafu ikauke kabla watoto hawajachezea. Suuza moppers na uzianike juani. Chupa ya ml 900 hadi lita 1 hudumu kwa familia takriban mwezi mmoja. Afya inauza sabuni ya chapa ya kuua bakteria na sabuni kali iliyokolea ya kirafiki kwa mazingira ili kufaa nyumba tofauti."],["Monthly repeat purchase with rainy-season peaks and a natural link to bleach and gloves.","Ununuzi unaorudiwa kila mwezi wenye ongezeko msimu wa mvua na uhusiano wa moja kwa moja na bleach na glavu."]],"fh_hyg_toil":[["Toilet cleaners are thick acidic or bleach-based liquids and gels shaped to reach under the rim, where they dissolve limescale and urine stains and kill germs in the bowl. Squeeze around the rim, leave for the time on the label, brush and flush; clean the seat, handle and door handle separately with a disinfectant, since these spread germs to hands. Never mix a toilet cleaner with bleach or other cleaners, as dangerous gases form, and store bottles with child-resistant caps closed and out of reach. A 500–750 ml bottle lasts a family around a month with twice-weekly cleaning. Afya stocks the leading brand in liquid and gel forms and in a large economy size.","Dawa za vyoo ni vimiminika na jeli nzito zenye asidi au bleach zenye umbo la kufikia chini ya ukingo, ambapo huyeyusha ukoko na madoa ya mkojo na kuua vijidudu ndani ya choo. Bonyeza kuzunguka ukingo, acha kwa muda ulioandikwa kwenye lebo, sugua kwa brashi na umwage maji; safisha kiti, kishikio cha kumwaga maji na kishikio cha mlango tofauti kwa dawa ya kuua vijidudu, kwa kuwa hivi husambaza vijidudu mikononi. Kamwe usichanganye dawa ya choo na bleach au sabuni nyingine, kwani gesi hatari hutokea, na hifadhi chupa zenye vifuniko visivyofunguliwa na watoto zikiwa zimefungwa na mbali na watoto. Chupa ya ml 500–750 hudumu kwa familia takriban mwezi mmoja kwa usafi wa mara mbili kwa wiki. Afya inauza chapa inayoongoza kwa aina za kimiminika na jeli na kwa saizi kubwa ya kubana matumizi."],["Universal monthly repurchase with a dominant trusted brand and strong rotation.","Ununuzi wa kila mwezi kwa kila nyumba wenye chapa kuu inayoaminika na mzunguko mkubwa."]],"fh_hyg_wipes":[["Antibacterial wipes are pre-moistened cloths that clean and disinfect small surfaces — phones, steering wheels, desks, high chairs and shopping trolley handles — and some are gentle enough for hands. They are useful for travel, offices and moments when there is no water, but should not replace handwashing with soap for visibly dirty hands, after using the toilet or before preparing food. Use one wipe per surface, keep the surface wet for the time on the pack, and close the pack tightly so wipes do not dry out. Never flush wipes; put them in the bin. Afya stocks a trusted 2-in-1 pack as a convenient everyday item for handbags, cars and desks.","Wipes za kuua bakteria ni vitambaa vyenye unyevu tayari vinavyosafisha na kuua vijidudu kwenye nyuso ndogo — simu, usukani wa gari, meza za kazi, viti vya kulia vya watoto na vishikio vya toroli za dukani — na baadhi ni laini kiasi cha kufaa mikono. Zinafaa kwa safari, ofisini na nyakati ambazo hakuna maji, lakini hazipaswi kuchukua nafasi ya kunawa mikono kwa sabuni pale mikono inapoonekana michafu, baada ya kutoka chooni au kabla ya kuandaa chakula. Tumia wipe moja kwa kila uso, acha uso ukiwa na unyevu kwa muda ulioandikwa kwenye pakiti, na funga pakiti vizuri ili wipes zisikauke. Kamwe usizitupe chooni; zitupe kwenye pipa la taka. Afya inauza pakiti inayoaminika ya matumizi mawili kama bidhaa rahisi ya kila siku kwa mikoba, magari na meza za kazi."],["Convenient, premium-priced impulse buy for commuters and offices.","Ununuzi wa ghafla rahisi wa bei ya juu kwa wasafiri wa kila siku na ofisi."]],"fh_hyg_gloves":[["Reusable rubber or latex household gloves protect hands from bleach, detergents, hot water and germs when cleaning toilets, washing dishes or handling soiled nappies, bedding and clothes of someone who is ill. Choose the right size — tight gloves tear and loose gloves slip — with a textured grip and a long cuff; people with latex allergy should choose latex-free types. Use separate colours for the toilet and the kitchen so germs are not carried between them. After use, wash the gloves while still on your hands, rinse, and hang them to dry; replace them as soon as they crack or leak. A pair lasts one to three months of daily use. Afya stocks several grip and comfort levels at value prices.","Glavu za mpira au latex za nyumbani zinazotumika tena hulinda mikono dhidi ya bleach, sabuni, maji ya moto na vijidudu wakati wa kusafisha vyoo, kuosha vyombo au kushika nepi chafu, matandiko na nguo za mgonjwa. Chagua saizi sahihi — glavu zinazobana huchanika na zilizolegea huteleza — zenye mshiko wenye mikunjo na mkono mrefu; watu wenye mzio wa latex wanapaswa kuchagua aina zisizo na latex. Tumia rangi tofauti kwa choo na jiko ili vijidudu visihamishwe kati yao. Baada ya kutumia, osha glavu zikiwa bado mikononi, suuza, na zitundike zikauke; zibadilishe mara tu zinapopasuka au kuvuja. Jozi moja hudumu mwezi mmoja hadi mitatu ya matumizi ya kila siku. Afya inauza viwango kadhaa vya mshiko na starehe kwa bei nafuu."],["Low-cost, frequently replaced add-on to every cleaning-product purchase.","Bidhaa ya kuongeza ya bei ndogo inayobadilishwa mara kwa mara pamoja na kila ununuzi wa sabuni za usafi."]],"fh_hyg_bins":[["Bin liners keep waste contained, reduce smells and flies, and make it safer to carry rubbish out of the home — important for used nappies, sanitary pads, dressings and food waste that attract pests and spread germs. Choose small draw-tape liners for bathroom and sanitary bins, medium scented bags for the kitchen, and heavy-duty large bags for outdoor bins and collection points. Tie bags firmly, do not overfill them, and wash bins regularly with soapy water or diluted bleach. Biodegradable liners suit customers who want to reduce plastic. Afya stocks three sizes, from bathroom to heavy-duty, as an everyday hygiene staple that pairs well with nappies and sanitary products.","Mifuko ya taka huhifadhi taka, hupunguza harufu na nzi, na hufanya iwe salama zaidi kutoa taka nje ya nyumba — jambo muhimu kwa nepi zilizotumika, pedi za hedhi, bendeji na taka za chakula zinazovutia wadudu na kusambaza vijidudu. Chagua mifuko midogo ya kamba kwa mapipa ya bafuni na ya bidhaa za hedhi, mifuko ya kati yenye harufu nzuri kwa jiko, na mifuko mikubwa imara kwa mapipa ya nje na sehemu za kukusanyia taka. Funga mifuko kwa uthabiti, usiijaze kupita kiasi, na osha mapipa mara kwa mara kwa maji ya sabuni au bleach iliyochanganywa na maji. Mifuko inayooza inawafaa wateja wanaotaka kupunguza plastiki. Afya inauza saizi tatu, kutoka za bafuni hadi imara, kama bidhaa ya msingi ya usafi wa kila siku inayoenda vizuri pamoja na nepi na bidhaa za hedhi."],["Everyday consumable that adds steady volume and pairs with nappies and period care.","Bidhaa ya matumizi ya kila siku inayoongeza mauzo ya kudumu na kuendana na nepi na huduma ya hedhi."]],"fh_hyg_tp":[["Toilet tissue is a daily hygiene essential, and good quality matters: soft, strong two-ply tissue cleans better with less paper and is gentler on children, older people and anyone with piles or sore skin. Tissue that dissolves easily is kinder to septic tanks and narrow pipes. Store rolls in a dry place off the floor, and always teach children to wash hands with soap after using the toilet, whatever the paper. A family of five typically uses 15–25 rolls a month, so multi-packs offer the best value and convenience, and single rolls suit small budgets. Afya stocks single rolls of local brands and 10–15-roll multipacks as a basket-building everyday item for home delivery and Afya Box subscriptions.","Karatasi za chooni ni bidhaa muhimu ya usafi ya kila siku, na ubora wake ni muhimu: karatasi laini na imara ya tabaka mbili husafisha vizuri zaidi kwa karatasi kidogo na ni laini zaidi kwa watoto, wazee na yeyote mwenye bawasiri au ngozi inayouma. Karatasi inayoyeyuka kwa urahisi ni nzuri zaidi kwa mashimo ya maji taka na mabomba membamba. Hifadhi mizunguko mahali pakavu juu ya sakafu, na daima wafundishe watoto kunawa mikono kwa sabuni baada ya kutumia choo, bila kujali karatasi. Familia ya watu watano kwa kawaida hutumia mizunguko 15–25 kwa mwezi, hivyo pakiti nyingi hutoa thamani na urahisi bora, na mzunguko mmoja unafaa bajeti ndogo. Afya inauza mizunguko moja moja ya chapa za hapa nchini na pakiti za mizunguko 10–15 kama bidhaa ya kila siku inayojenga kikapu kwa usafirishaji wa nyumbani na usajili wa Afya Box."],["Highest-frequency household consumable; ideal for subscriptions and delivery baskets.","Bidhaa ya matumizi ya nyumbani inayonunuliwa mara nyingi zaidi; bora kwa usajili na vikapu vya usafirishaji."]],"fh_hyg_laund":[["Clean clothing, bedding and towels are part of preventing skin infections, scabies, fungal rashes and the spread of diarrhoea, especially when someone in the home is ill. Choose a hand-wash powder for washing in a basin, measure the dose on the pack rather than adding extra, and rinse well, because detergent left in fabric can irritate sensitive skin and babies. Wash bedding and towels of a sick person separately in the hottest water the fabric allows, and add diluted bleach for white cottons and nappies. Dry clothes fully in the sun, which also helps kill germs. A family uses roughly 2–4 kg a month. Afya stocks three trusted value brands as a high-volume everyday item that completes the home-hygiene basket.","Nguo, matandiko na taulo safi ni sehemu ya kuzuia maambukizi ya ngozi, upele, fangasi na kuenea kwa kuharisha, hasa mtu nyumbani anapokuwa mgonjwa. Chagua sabuni ya unga ya kufulia kwa mkono kwa kufua kwenye beseni, pima kiasi kilichoandikwa kwenye pakiti badala ya kuongeza zaidi, na suuza vizuri, kwa sababu sabuni inayobaki kwenye kitambaa inaweza kuwasha ngozi nyeti na watoto wachanga. Fua matandiko na taulo za mgonjwa tofauti kwa maji ya moto kadiri kitambaa kinavyoruhusu, na ongeza bleach iliyochanganywa na maji kwa nguo nyeupe za pamba na nepi. Anika nguo hadi zikauke kabisa juani, jambo linalosaidia pia kuua vijidudu. Familia hutumia takriban kilo 2–4 kwa mwezi. Afya inauza chapa tatu za bei nafuu zinazoaminika kama bidhaa ya kila siku ya mauzo makubwa inayokamilisha kikapu cha usafi wa nyumbani."],["High-volume weekly staple that brings non-pharmacy footfall and fills delivery baskets.","Bidhaa ya msingi ya mauzo makubwa kila wiki inayoleta wateja wasio wa dawa na kujaza vikapu vya usafirishaji."]],"fh_hyg_scrub":[["Scrub sponges combine a soft absorbent side for dishes and surfaces with a rougher scouring side for pots, pans and sinks, and they are used every day in every kitchen. Because a damp sponge quickly becomes one of the germiest objects in the home, hygiene depends on how it is cared for: rinse it well after use, squeeze it out, let it dry upright, and replace it every one to two weeks or as soon as it smells. Keep separate sponges for dishes and for bathroom or floor cleaning, and never use a kitchen sponge to wipe up raw-meat juices without washing it afterwards. Gentle scrub sides protect non-stick pans and enamel. A four-pack lasts a family about a month. Afya stocks a value multipack to sit beside dishwashing and cleaning products.","Sponji za kusugua huchanganya upande laini unaofyonza kwa vyombo na nyuso pamoja na upande mgumu wa kukwaruza kwa sufuria, vikaango na sinki, na hutumika kila siku katika kila jiko. Kwa kuwa sponji yenye unyevu haraka huwa mojawapo ya vitu vyenye vijidudu vingi zaidi nyumbani, usafi hutegemea jinsi inavyotunzwa: isuuze vizuri baada ya kutumia, ikamue, iache ikauke ikiwa imesimama, na ibadilishe kila wiki moja hadi mbili au mara tu inapotoa harufu. Weka sponji tofauti kwa vyombo na kwa kusafisha bafu au sakafu, na kamwe usitumie sponji ya jikoni kufuta majimaji ya nyama mbichi bila kuiosha baadaye. Upande laini wa kukwaruza hulinda sufuria zisizonata na vyombo vya enameli. Pakiti ya vipande vinne hudumu kwa familia takriban mwezi mmoja. Afya inauza pakiti ya bei nafuu ya vipande vingi kando ya sabuni za vyombo na za usafi."],["Cheap, frequently replaced kitchen staple that rounds out every cleaning basket.","Bidhaa ya msingi ya jikoni nafuu inayobadilishwa mara kwa mara na kukamilisha kila kikapu cha usafi."]],"fh_pest_fik":[["Multi-insect aerosols kill both flying insects such as flies and mosquitoes and crawling ones such as cockroaches, making them the single most useful pest product for most homes; flies carry diarrhoeal germs onto food, and cockroaches contaminate kitchens. Spray flying insects directly or into the air of a closed room, then leave and ventilate after 15–20 minutes; spray crawling insects into cracks, under sinks and behind cupboards. Cover or remove food, utensils, water and pet bowls first, keep children and pets out of the room, and never spray near flames or onto people. Odourless versions suit bedrooms and families sensitive to smell. Afya stocks value and premium brands in two sizes because pest control is a constant need in Dar es Salaam homes.","Dawa za gesi za wadudu wa aina nyingi huua wadudu wanaoruka kama nzi na mbu na wanaotambaa kama mende, hivyo ni bidhaa moja yenye manufaa zaidi ya kudhibiti wadudu kwa nyumba nyingi; nzi hubeba vijidudu vya kuharisha kwenye chakula, na mende huchafua majiko. Nyunyiza wadudu wanaoruka moja kwa moja au hewani ndani ya chumba kilichofungwa, kisha toka na fungua hewa baada ya dakika 15–20; nyunyiza wadudu wanaotambaa kwenye nyufa, chini ya sinki na nyuma ya makabati. Funika au ondoa chakula, vyombo, maji na vyombo vya wanyama kwanza, weka watoto na wanyama nje ya chumba, na kamwe usinyunyize karibu na moto au kwa watu. Aina zisizo na harufu zinafaa vyumba vya kulala na familia zinazoathiriwa na harufu. Afya inauza chapa za bei nafuu na za juu kwa saizi mbili kwa sababu kudhibiti wadudu ni hitaji la kudumu katika nyumba za Dar es Salaam."],["Constant household need with branded margin and rainy-season peaks.","Hitaji la kudumu la kaya lenye faida ya chapa na ongezeko msimu wa mvua."]],"fh_pest_crawl":[["Crawling-insect sprays are formulated to be applied directly to the hiding places of cockroaches, ants and other crawling pests — cracks, skirting boards, drains, under sinks and behind appliances — where they leave a residual layer that keeps working for days or weeks. Treat the whole infested area at once, focusing on dark, damp corners, and combine spraying with good hygiene: store food in sealed containers, wipe crumbs, fix leaking taps and take rubbish out daily. Keep children and pets away until the spray has dried, never spray onto food-preparation surfaces, and wash hands after use. For bedbugs, wash bedding in hot water and dry it in the sun as well. Afya stocks a specialist crawling-insect spray and a larger multi-insect can.","Dawa za kunyunyiza za wadudu wanaotambaa zimetengenezwa kupakwa moja kwa moja kwenye maficho ya mende, siafu na wadudu wengine wanaotambaa — nyufa, kingo za chini za kuta, mifereji, chini ya sinki na nyuma ya vifaa vya nyumbani — ambapo huacha tabaka linaloendelea kufanya kazi kwa siku au wiki. Tibu eneo lote lililoathirika kwa wakati mmoja, ukizingatia pembe zenye giza na unyevu, na changanya kunyunyiza na usafi mzuri: hifadhi chakula katika vyombo vilivyofungwa, futa makombo, rekebisha mabomba yanayovuja na toa taka kila siku. Weka watoto na wanyama mbali hadi dawa ikauke, kamwe usinyunyize kwenye nyuso za kuandaa chakula, na nawa mikono baada ya kutumia. Kwa kunguni, fua matandiko kwa maji ya moto na uyaanike juani pia. Afya inauza dawa maalum ya wadudu wanaotambaa na kopo kubwa la wadudu wa aina nyingi."],["Targets the most-complained-about kitchen pest with a premium residual product.","Hulenga mdudu wa jikoni anayelalamikiwa zaidi kwa bidhaa ya hali ya juu inayodumu kufanya kazi."]],"fh_pest_roach":[["Cockroach powders are dusted thinly into places cockroaches travel and hide — behind cookers and fridges, under sinks, along pipes and drains — where the insects walk through them and carry the poison back to the nest, killing more than sprays reach. A light dusting works better than heaps, which cockroaches avoid. Keep powder out of food cupboards, off work surfaces and well away from children and pets; wear gloves and wash hands after use, and reapply after cleaning or every few weeks. Results take several days, so combine with sealing cracks and removing food and water sources. Afya stocks a value powder for households and small food businesses that need steady, low-cost control.","Unga wa mende hunyunyizwa kwa wepesi mahali ambapo mende hupita na kujificha — nyuma ya majiko na friji, chini ya sinki, kando ya mabomba na mifereji — ambapo wadudu hupita juu yake na kubeba sumu kurudi kwenye viota vyao, wakiua wengi kuliko wale wanaofikiwa na dawa za kunyunyiza. Kunyunyiza kidogo hufanya kazi vizuri zaidi kuliko marundo, ambayo mende huyaepuka. Weka unga mbali na makabati ya chakula, nje ya nyuso za kazi na mbali kabisa na watoto na wanyama; vaa glavu na nawa mikono baada ya kutumia, na weka tena baada ya kusafisha au kila baada ya wiki chache. Matokeo huchukua siku kadhaa, hivyo changanya na kuziba nyufa na kuondoa vyanzo vya chakula na maji. Afya inauza unga wa bei nafuu kwa kaya na biashara ndogo za chakula zinazohitaji udhibiti wa kudumu kwa gharama ndogo."],["Cheap, effective and repeat-bought by households and small food businesses.","Nafuu, yenye ufanisi na inanunuliwa tena na kaya na biashara ndogo za chakula."]],"fh_pest_de":[["Food-grade diatomaceous earth is a fine natural powder made from fossilised algae; its microscopic sharp edges damage the waxy coat of crawling insects such as cockroaches, ants, bedbugs and fleas so they dry out and die, without chemical insecticides. It suits homes with babies, pets or people sensitive to sprays, and it keeps working as long as it stays dry. Dust a thin layer along skirting boards, behind appliances, under mattresses and in cracks, leave it for several days, then vacuum or sweep and reapply. Avoid breathing the dust — apply gently and wear a mask in enclosed spaces — and reapply after mopping or rain. Afya stocks it as a premium eco alternative for families who prefer non-toxic pest control.","Udongo wa diatomu wa kiwango cha chakula ni unga laini wa asili unaotokana na mwani wa zamani uliogeuka mawe; kingo zake zenye ncha kali zisizoonekana kwa macho huharibu ganda la nta la wadudu wanaotambaa kama mende, siafu, kunguni na viroboto ili wakauke na kufa, bila dawa za kemikali za wadudu. Unafaa nyumba zenye watoto wachanga, wanyama au watu wanaoathiriwa na dawa za kunyunyiza, na huendelea kufanya kazi muda wote ukiwa mkavu. Nyunyiza safu nyembamba kando ya kingo za chini za kuta, nyuma ya vifaa vya nyumbani, chini ya magodoro na kwenye nyufa, uache kwa siku kadhaa, kisha fyonza kwa mashine au fagia na uweke tena. Epuka kuvuta vumbi lake — weka kwa upole na vaa barakoa katika maeneo yaliyofungwa — na weka tena baada ya kupiga deki au mvua. Afya inauza unga huu kama mbadala wa hali ya juu wa kirafiki kwa mazingira kwa familia zinazopendelea kudhibiti wadudu bila sumu."],["Differentiated eco product with premium margin for health-conscious families.","Bidhaa ya kipekee ya kirafiki kwa mazingira yenye faida kubwa kwa familia zinazojali afya."]],"fh_pest_rat":[["Rats and mice contaminate food and surfaces with urine and droppings and spread diseases such as leptospirosis and salmonella, and they increase after the rains. Glue boards catch rodents without poison, which avoids the risk of children or pets eating bait and of poisoned rats dying in walls. Place traps flat along walls and in dark runways where droppings are seen, several at a time, and check them every morning; wear gloves to dispose of a trap in a sealed bag. Because glue traps can cause suffering, check them often and deal with any catch promptly. Seal holes, store food in closed containers and remove rubbish to stop rodents returning. Afya stocks standard and jumbo traps as a safe, low-cost first step.","Panya huchafua chakula na nyuso kwa mkojo na kinyesi chao na kusambaza magonjwa kama leptospirosis na salmonella, na huongezeka baada ya mvua. Mbao za gundi hunasa panya bila sumu, jambo linaloepusha hatari ya watoto au wanyama kula chambo na ya panya waliotiwa sumu kufia ndani ya kuta. Weka mitego ikiwa bapa kando ya kuta na katika njia zenye giza ambapo kinyesi kinaonekana, kadhaa kwa wakati mmoja, na iangalie kila asubuhi; vaa glavu kutupa mtego ndani ya mfuko uliofungwa. Kwa kuwa mitego ya gundi inaweza kusababisha mateso, iangalie mara kwa mara na shughulikia panya aliyenaswa mara moja. Ziba matundu, hifadhi chakula katika vyombo vilivyofungwa na ondoa taka ili kuzuia panya kurudi. Afya inauza mitego ya kawaida na mikubwa kama hatua ya kwanza salama na ya gharama ndogo."],["Poison-free, low-cost solution with steady demand from homes, shops and food stalls.","Suluhisho lisilo na sumu na la bei nafuu lenye mahitaji ya kudumu kutoka nyumbani, madukani na vibanda vya chakula."]],"fh_kit_kit":[["A ready-made first-aid kit gathers the essentials — plasters, gauze, bandages, tape, antiseptic wipes, scissors and tweezers — in one labelled pouch, so that help is at hand within seconds after a fall, cut or road accident. A compact zip-bag kit suits a car, handbag or office drawer; families should also keep a larger home box, and workplaces should follow the size required for their number of staff. Check the kit every three to six months, replace anything used or expired, and add personal items such as paracetamol, ORS and any regular medicines. Make sure everyone in the household knows where it is. Afya stocks a compact kit as a ready gift and car essential, and can build larger kits on request.","Kisanduku cha huduma ya kwanza kilichokamilika hukusanya vitu muhimu — plasta, gozi, bendeji, tepu, wipes za kuua vijidudu, mkasi na koleo ndogo — ndani ya mfuko mmoja wenye alama, ili msaada upatikane ndani ya sekunde chache baada ya kuanguka, kukatwa au ajali ya barabarani. Kisanduku kidogo cha mfuko wa zipu kinafaa gari, mkoba au droo ya ofisini; familia zinapaswa pia kuwa na sanduku kubwa la nyumbani, na mahali pa kazi wanapaswa kufuata ukubwa unaohitajika kwa idadi ya wafanyakazi wao. Kagua kisanduku kila miezi mitatu hadi sita, badilisha kilichotumika au kilichoisha muda, na ongeza vitu binafsi kama paracetamol, ORS na dawa zozote za kawaida. Hakikisha kila mtu nyumbani anajua kilipo. Afya inauza kisanduku kidogo kama zawadi tayari na hitaji la gari, na inaweza kutengeneza visanduku vikubwa kwa ombi."],["High-value bundle that pulls through refills and suits gifting, cars and corporate orders.","Kifurushi cha thamani kubwa kinacholeta mauzo ya vijazo na kinafaa zawadi, magari na oda za makampuni."]],"fh_kit_box":[["A dedicated box keeps medicines and first-aid supplies in one place, protected from heat, damp, dust and ants, and — with a latch or lock — out of children’s reach, which is the most important way to prevent childhood poisoning. Choose a box with compartments or trays so items can be found quickly, a secure latch, and a handle for carrying to where it is needed. Store it in a cool, dry place away from the kitchen steam and bathroom humidity, not in a car in the sun, and keep medicines in their original packs with the leaflet. Check expiry dates every few months. Afya stocks an empty box at value and a multi-layer latched box so families can build their own kit.","Sanduku maalum huhifadhi dawa na vifaa vya huduma ya kwanza mahali pamoja, vikilindwa dhidi ya joto, unyevu, vumbi na siafu, na — likiwa na kitasa au kufuli — mbali na watoto, jambo ambalo ndiyo njia muhimu zaidi ya kuzuia watoto kupata sumu. Chagua sanduku lenye vyumba au trei ili vitu vipatikane haraka, kitasa imara, na kishikio cha kubeba hadi mahali kinapohitajika. Lihifadhi mahali pa baridi na pakavu mbali na mvuke wa jikoni na unyevu wa bafuni, si ndani ya gari juani, na weka dawa katika pakiti zake halisi pamoja na karatasi ya maelezo. Kagua tarehe za mwisho wa matumizi kila baada ya miezi michache. Afya inauza sanduku tupu la bei nafuu na sanduku la tabaka nyingi lenye kitasa ili familia zitengeneze kisanduku chao wenyewe."],["Child-safety message that sells easily with every first-aid starter basket.","Ujumbe wa usalama wa watoto unaouzika kwa urahisi pamoja na kila kikapu cha kuanzia cha huduma ya kwanza."]],"fh_kit_sci":[["First-aid scissors are used to cut tape, gauze, dressings and bandages to size and, in an emergency, to cut clothing away from an injury. Blunt-tipped or angled bandage scissors are safest because the lower blade slides under a bandage without cutting the skin. Keep a pair only for first aid so it stays clean and sharp, wipe the blades with alcohol after use, and store it in the kit rather than the kitchen drawer. Stainless steel resists rust in humid Dar es Salaam weather. Afya stocks an affordable pair because scissors are the item most often missing from home kits.","Mikasi ya huduma ya kwanza hutumika kukata tepu, gozi, bendeji na pedi kwa ukubwa unaohitajika na, wakati wa dharura, kukata nguo kutoka kwenye jeraha. Mikasi ya bendeji yenye ncha butu au iliyopinda ndiyo salama zaidi kwa sababu ubapa wa chini huteleza chini ya bendeji bila kukata ngozi. Weka mkasi mmoja kwa ajili ya huduma ya kwanza tu ili ubaki safi na mkali, futa makali yake kwa alkoholi baada ya kutumia, na uuhifadhi ndani ya kisanduku badala ya droo ya jikoni. Chuma kisichoshika kutu hustahimili hali ya hewa yenye unyevu ya Dar es Salaam. Afya inauza mkasi wa bei nafuu kwa sababu mkasi ndio kifaa kinachokosekana mara nyingi zaidi katika visanduku vya nyumbani."],["Small, cheap tool that completes kits and is an easy counter add-on.","Kifaa kidogo na nafuu kinachokamilisha visanduku na ni rahisi kuongeza kaunta."]],"fh_kit_twz":[["Good tweezers with fine, well-aligned tips make it easy to remove splinters, thorns, glass fragments and ticks before they cause infection. Slanted tips grip flat splinters, while pointed tips reach deeply embedded ones. Clean the skin and the tweezers with alcohol first, grip the splinter close to the skin and pull out along the line it went in; for ticks, grip as close to the skin as possible and pull straight up steadily without twisting. Wash the area afterwards and cover it with a plaster. Do not dig deeply — splinters under a nail, in the eye or very deep should be removed at a clinic. Afya stocks precision stainless-steel tweezers at two price points.","Koleo ndogo nzuri zenye ncha nyembamba zinazokutana vizuri hurahisisha kutoa vibanzi, miiba, vipande vya glasi na kupe kabla havijasababisha maambukizi. Ncha zilizoinama hushika vibanzi bapa, wakati ncha zenye makali hufikia vile vilivyozama ndani. Safisha ngozi na koleo kwa alkoholi kwanza, shika kibanzi karibu na ngozi na kivute kufuata mstari kilipoingilia; kwa kupe, mshike karibu na ngozi kadiri iwezekanavyo na umvute juu moja kwa moja kwa uthabiti bila kuzungusha. Osha eneo hilo baadaye na ulifunike kwa plasta. Usichimbue ndani sana — vibanzi vilivyo chini ya kucha, jichoni au vilivyozama sana vinapaswa kutolewa kliniki. Afya inauza koleo ndogo za chuma kisichoshika kutu zenye usahihi kwa bei mbili."],["Durable tool with good margin that every kit and family should have.","Kifaa cha kudumu chenye faida nzuri ambacho kila kisanduku na familia inapaswa kuwa nacho."]],"fh_kit_tri":[["A triangular bandage is a large triangle of cotton or non-woven fabric that can be folded into an arm sling to support a suspected broken arm, wrist or collarbone, used as a pad over a wound, or tied to hold a splint in place. To make a sling, place the long edge along the body, bring the lower point up over the injured arm to the shoulder and tie at the side of the neck, keeping the hand slightly higher than the elbow. Check fingers for colour and warmth, and take the person for an X-ray if a fracture is possible. Individually packed sterile versions can also cover burns and large wounds. Afya stocks a value bandage and an individually packed version for kits.","Bendeji ya pembetatu ni kitambaa kikubwa cha pembetatu cha pamba au kitambaa kisichofumwa kinachoweza kukunjwa kuwa kibebeo cha mkono ili kusaidia mkono, kiganja au mfupa wa bega unaodhaniwa kuvunjika, kutumika kama pedi juu ya kidonda, au kufungwa kushikilia banzi mahali pake. Kutengeneza kibebeo, weka upande mrefu kando ya mwili, leta ncha ya chini juu ya mkono uliojeruhiwa hadi begani na funga upande wa shingo, ukiweka kiganja juu kidogo kuliko kiwiko. Angalia vidole kwa rangi na joto, na mpeleke mtu kupigwa picha ya X-ray ikiwa kuna uwezekano wa kuvunjika. Aina tasa zilizofungwa kila moja peke yake zinaweza pia kufunika kuungua na vidonda vikubwa. Afya inauza bendeji ya bei nafuu na aina iliyofungwa peke yake kwa visanduku."],["Inexpensive core kit component needed by schools, workplaces and sports clubs.","Kifaa cha msingi cha kisanduku chenye bei nafuu kinachohitajika na shule, mahali pa kazi na vilabu vya michezo."]],"fh_kit_swab":[["Alcohol swabs are individually sealed pads soaked in 70% isopropyl alcohol, used to clean intact skin before an injection, insulin dose or finger-prick test, and to wipe thermometers, tweezers and scissors. Because each swab is sealed, it stays clean and moist until used, which makes them ideal for first-aid kits, travel and diabetes care. Wipe the skin firmly and let it dry completely before pricking — wet alcohol stings and can affect blood-glucose readings. Do not use them on open wounds or on babies’ delicate skin for long periods, and keep away from flames. A box of 100 lasts a family many months, or about a month for someone testing several times a day. Afya stocks the 100-box at a low price.","Pamba za spiriti ni pedi zilizofungwa kila moja peke yake zilizolowekwa kwenye alkoholi ya isopropyl ya asilimia 70, zinazotumika kusafisha ngozi nzima kabla ya sindano, dozi ya insulini au kipimo cha kuchoma kidole, na kufuta vipimajoto, koleo ndogo na mikasi. Kwa kuwa kila pamba imefungwa, hubaki safi na yenye unyevu hadi inapotumika, jambo linalozifanya zifae visanduku vya huduma ya kwanza, safari na huduma ya kisukari. Futa ngozi kwa nguvu na uiache ikauke kabisa kabla ya kuchoma — alkoholi ikiwa bado na unyevu huuma na inaweza kuathiri vipimo vya sukari. Usizitumie kwenye vidonda vilivyo wazi au kwenye ngozi nyororo ya watoto wachanga kwa muda mrefu, na ziweke mbali na moto. Boksi la vipande 100 hudumu kwa familia miezi mingi, au takriban mwezi mmoja kwa mtu anayepima mara kadhaa kwa siku. Afya inauza boksi la 100 kwa bei ya chini."],["Cheap, high-rotation consumable shared between first aid and diabetes customers.","Bidhaa ya matumizi nafuu yenye mzunguko mkubwa inayowahudumia wateja wa huduma ya kwanza na wa kisukari."]],"fh_kit_card":[["In an emergency people forget what they know, so a laminated card in Kiswahili and English that sets out the key steps — checking for danger and response, calling for help, recovery position, stopping bleeding, cooling burns, choking, fits and dehydration — helps anyone act quickly and correctly. The Afya card follows the International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies 2020 first-aid guidelines and is wipe-clean for use in kitchens, cars and classrooms. Keep one inside the first-aid kit lid and another on the fridge or classroom wall, and write local emergency numbers on the back. It does not replace a first-aid course, which every household should aim to take. Afya provides it at a nominal price as a public-health service that builds trust.","Wakati wa dharura watu husahau wanachokijua, hivyo kadi iliyofunikwa kwa plastiki kwa Kiswahili na Kiingereza inayoonyesha hatua muhimu — kuangalia hatari na kama mtu anaitika, kuita msaada, kumlaza mtu kwa ubavu, kuzuia damu kutoka, kupoza kuungua, kukwama koo, degedege na upungufu wa maji mwilini — humsaidia yeyote kuchukua hatua haraka na kwa usahihi. Kadi ya Afya inafuata miongozo ya huduma ya kwanza ya mwaka 2020 ya Shirikisho la Kimataifa la Vyama vya Msalaba Mwekundu na Hilali Nyekundu na inaweza kufutwa kwa kitambaa kwa matumizi jikoni, garini na darasani. Weka moja ndani ya kifuniko cha kisanduku cha huduma ya kwanza na nyingine kwenye friji au ukuta wa darasa, na andika namba za dharura za eneo lako upande wa nyuma. Haichukui nafasi ya mafunzo ya huduma ya kwanza, ambayo kila kaya inapaswa kulenga kuyapata. Afya inaitoa kwa bei ndogo kama huduma ya afya ya jamii inayojenga imani."],["Own-label trust builder that adds value to every kit and school order.","Bidhaa ya chapa ya Afya inayojenga imani na kuongeza thamani kwa kila kisanduku na oda ya shule."]],"fh_kit_eye":[["Sterile eye wash solutions gently rinse dust, sand, smoke and small particles from the eye and soothe mild irritation from wind, sun and long screen use — common problems on dusty roads and boda-boda journeys. Use the eyebath or nozzle provided, tilt the head and rinse the eye open, then discard the solution; never share eyebaths between people. For chemicals in the eye, including bleach or cleaning products, rinse immediately with plenty of clean running water for at least 15 minutes and go to a clinic. Seek care urgently for a painful red eye, blurred vision, light sensitivity, a penetrating injury or anything that will not wash out. Afya stocks a branded eye wash as a premium addition to home and workplace kits.","Dawa tasa za kuosha macho huosha kwa upole vumbi, mchanga, moshi na chembe ndogo kutoka machoni na kutuliza muwasho mdogo unaotokana na upepo, jua na kutazama skrini muda mrefu — matatizo ya kawaida kwenye barabara zenye vumbi na safari za bodaboda. Tumia kikombe cha kuosha macho au mdomo wa chupa uliotolewa, inamisha kichwa na osha jicho likiwa wazi, kisha tupa dawa hiyo; kamwe msitumie kikombe kimoja watu tofauti. Kwa kemikali machoni, ikiwemo bleach au sabuni za usafi, osha mara moja kwa maji mengi safi yanayotiririka kwa angalau dakika 15 na nenda kliniki. Tafuta huduma haraka kwa jicho jekundu linalouma, kuona kwa ukungu, kuumizwa na mwanga, jeraha la kitu kilichoingia ndani au chochote kisichotoka kwa kuosha. Afya inauza dawa ya chapa ya kuosha macho kama nyongeza ya hali ya juu kwa visanduku vya nyumbani na mahali pa kazi."],["Premium specialist item for workplaces, drivers and dusty-season shoppers.","Bidhaa maalum ya hali ya juu kwa mahali pa kazi, madereva na wanunuzi wa msimu wa vumbi."]],"fh_ppe_latex":[["Disposable latex examination gloves give a thin, sensitive barrier that protects both carer and patient when dressing wounds, changing continence pads or nappies, cleaning up blood or vomit, and in salons and small clinics. Choose a size that fits snugly (most adults need medium), and powder-free gloves, which irritate skin less and do not contaminate wounds. Put gloves on with clean hands, change them between tasks and patients, remove them by peeling inside out without touching the outer surface, bin them, and wash your hands — gloves never replace handwashing. Anyone with a latex allergy should use nitrile instead. A box of 100 lasts a home carer about a month. Afya stocks powdered and powder-free boxes at value prices.","Glavu za uchunguzi za latex za kutupa hutoa kizuizi chembamba na chenye hisia kinacholinda mlezi na mgonjwa wakati wa kufunga vidonda, kubadilisha pedi za kushindwa kujizuia au nepi, kusafisha damu au matapishi, na katika saluni na kliniki ndogo. Chagua saizi inayobana vizuri (watu wazima wengi wanahitaji ya kati), na glavu zisizo na unga, ambazo huwasha ngozi kidogo na hazichafui vidonda. Vaa glavu ukiwa na mikono safi, zibadilishe kati ya kazi na kati ya wagonjwa, zivue kwa kuzigeuza ndani nje bila kugusa upande wa nje, zitupe kwenye pipa, na nawa mikono — glavu kamwe hazichukui nafasi ya kunawa mikono. Mtu yeyote mwenye mzio wa latex anapaswa kutumia za nitrile badala yake. Boksi la 100 hudumu kwa mlezi wa nyumbani takriban mwezi mmoja. Afya inauza boksi zenye unga na zisizo na unga kwa bei nafuu."],["Bulk consumable bought monthly by carers, salons and clinics.","Bidhaa ya matumizi kwa wingi inayonunuliwa kila mwezi na walezi, saluni na kliniki."]],"fh_ppe_nitr":[["Nitrile gloves are made from a synthetic rubber that contains no latex, so they are safe for people with latex allergy and are more resistant to punctures, oils and cleaning chemicals than latex. They suit carers who wear gloves for long periods, salon and barbershop work with dyes and relaxers, food businesses and handling bleach or disinfectants. Choose powder-free gloves in a close-fitting size; thicker gloves give more protection but less fingertip feel. As with all disposable gloves, change them between tasks, remove carefully and wash hands afterwards. Afya stocks two nitrile options for customers who need allergy-safe, stronger protection.","Glavu za nitrile zimetengenezwa kwa mpira bandia usio na latex, hivyo ni salama kwa watu wenye mzio wa latex na hustahimili zaidi kutobolewa, mafuta na kemikali za usafi kuliko latex. Zinawafaa walezi wanaovaa glavu kwa muda mrefu, kazi za saluni na kinyozi zinazohusisha rangi za nywele na dawa za kulainisha nywele, biashara za chakula na kushika bleach au dawa za kuua vijidudu. Chagua glavu zisizo na unga za saizi inayobana vizuri; glavu nene zaidi hutoa kinga zaidi lakini hisia kidogo kwenye ncha za vidole. Kama glavu zote za kutupa, zibadilishe kati ya kazi, zivue kwa uangalifu na nawa mikono baadaye. Afya inauza chaguo mbili za nitrile kwa wateja wanaohitaji kinga imara zaidi isiyoleta mzio."],["Premium-priced glove line favoured by salons and professional carers.","Glavu za bei ya juu zinazopendelewa na saluni na walezi wa kitaaluma."]],"fh_ppe_food":[["Thin polyethylene food-handling gloves are a low-cost barrier for preparing and serving ready-to-eat food — salads, fruit, chapati, sandwiches and snacks — where bare hands could pass on germs that cause diarrhoea and typhoid. They are loose-fitting and quick to put on and change, which suits busy food stalls, school kitchens, weddings and Ramadan iftar catering. Wash hands before putting them on, change gloves after touching raw meat, money, phones or the face, and never reuse them. They are not suitable for medical care or handling chemicals. A box of 100 lasts a small food business about a week. Afya stocks a value box for households and food vendors.","Glavu nyembamba za polyethylene za kushika chakula ni kizuizi cha gharama ndogo cha kuandaa na kupakua chakula kilicho tayari kuliwa — saladi, matunda, chapati, sandwichi na vitafunio — ambapo mikono mitupu inaweza kusambaza vijidudu vinavyosababisha kuharisha na homa ya matumbo. Hazibani na ni rahisi kuvaa na kubadilisha, jambo linalofaa vibanda vya chakula vyenye shughuli nyingi, majiko ya shule, harusi na huduma za chakula cha futari wakati wa Ramadhani. Nawa mikono kabla ya kuzivaa, badilisha glavu baada ya kugusa nyama mbichi, pesa, simu au uso, na kamwe usizitumie tena. Hazifai kwa huduma za kitabibu au kushika kemikali. Boksi la vipande 100 hudumu kwa biashara ndogo ya chakula takriban wiki moja. Afya inauza boksi la bei nafuu kwa kaya na wauzaji wa chakula."],["Very cheap, fast-moving item that wins small food businesses and event caterers.","Bidhaa nafuu sana inayouzika haraka na kuvutia biashara ndogo za chakula na wahudumu wa sherehe."]],"fh_ppe_mask":[["Three-ply disposable masks reduce the spread of droplets from a person who is coughing or sneezing and offer some protection to carers looking after someone with a respiratory infection, as well as against dust on roads and building sites. Choose masks with a bendable nose wire and ear loops that fit snugly, wear them covering nose and chin, and change them when damp or after about four hours. Do not touch the front while wearing; remove by the loops, bin them and clean your hands. Masks for children should be child-sized and are not recommended for under-twos. A box of 50 lasts a household several weeks during an illness. Afya stocks two value boxes for families, offices and transport workers.","Barakoa za kutupa za tabaka tatu hupunguza kuenea kwa matone kutoka kwa mtu anayekohoa au kupiga chafya na hutoa kinga kiasi kwa walezi wanaomhudumia mtu mwenye maambukizi ya njia ya hewa, pamoja na kinga dhidi ya vumbi barabarani na kwenye maeneo ya ujenzi. Chagua barakoa zenye waya wa pua unaopinda na kamba za masikio zinazobana vizuri, zivae zikifunika pua na kidevu, na zibadilishe zikilowa au baada ya takriban saa nne. Usiguse sehemu ya mbele ukiwa umeivaa; ivue kwa kushika kamba, itupe kwenye pipa na safisha mikono yako. Barakoa za watoto zinapaswa kuwa za saizi ya watoto na hazipendekezwi kwa walio chini ya miaka miwili. Boksi la 50 hudumu kwa kaya wiki kadhaa wakati wa ugonjwa. Afya inauza boksi mbili za bei nafuu kwa familia, ofisi na wafanyakazi wa usafiri."],["Low-cost, high-volume item with demand surges in flu season and outbreaks.","Bidhaa ya bei ndogo na mauzo makubwa yenye mahitaji yanayopanda ghafla msimu wa mafua na milipuko."]],"fh_ppe_cut":[["Cut-resistant gloves are knitted from high-strength fibres that resist slicing, protecting hands when filleting fish, cutting meat and vegetables quickly, opening tins, handling broken glass or sheet metal, and grating — some of the commonest causes of deep hand cuts that need stitches. Level 5 gloves (the highest common rating) are recommended for kitchens and fish markets. Choose a snug fit so grip is not lost, wear one on the hand holding the food, and wash them in warm soapy water after use and dry them fully. They resist cuts but do not stop punctures from knife points, so care is still needed. Afya stocks two level-5 options as a prevention product that saves clinic visits.","Glavu zisizokatika kwa urahisi zimefumwa kwa nyuzi zenye nguvu kubwa zinazostahimili kukatwa, zikilinda mikono wakati wa kupara samaki, kukata nyama na mboga kwa haraka, kufungua makopo, kushika vioo vilivyovunjika au mabati, na kukuna — baadhi ya sababu za kawaida zaidi za mikato mirefu ya mkono inayohitaji kushonwa. Glavu za kiwango cha 5 (kiwango cha juu kinachojulikana) zinapendekezwa kwa majiko na masoko ya samaki. Chagua zinazobana vizuri ili mshiko usipotee, vaa moja kwenye mkono unaoshika chakula, na zioshe kwa maji ya uvuguvugu yenye sabuni baada ya kutumia na uzikaushe kabisa. Zinastahimili kukatwa lakini hazizuii kuchomwa na ncha ya kisu, hivyo uangalifu bado unahitajika. Afya inauza chaguo mbili za kiwango cha 5 kama bidhaa ya kinga inayookoa safari za kliniki."],["Differentiated injury-prevention product with strong appeal to cooks and fish traders.","Bidhaa ya kipekee ya kuzuia majeraha yenye mvuto mkubwa kwa wapishi na wafanyabiashara wa samaki."]],"fh_ppe_apron":[["A wipe-clean PVC apron protects clothing and skin from splashes of body fluids, water, bleach and food when bathing a patient or baby, changing continence pads, cleaning bathrooms or cooking. It reduces the chance of carrying germs from one task to another on clothing, which matters when caring for someone with diarrhoea or an infected wound. Wipe it down with soapy water or diluted bleach after each care task, hang it to dry, and keep separate aprons for personal care and for the kitchen. Choose a full-length apron with adjustable neck and waist ties. Afya stocks a durable reusable apron for family carers who do daily hands-on care.","Aproni ya PVC inayofutika kwa kitambaa hulinda nguo na ngozi dhidi ya michirizi ya majimaji ya mwili, maji, bleach na chakula wakati wa kumwogesha mgonjwa au mtoto, kubadilisha pedi za kushindwa kujizuia, kusafisha bafu au kupika. Hupunguza uwezekano wa kubeba vijidudu kutoka kazi moja hadi nyingine kupitia nguo, jambo muhimu unapomhudumia mtu anayeharisha au mwenye kidonda kilichoambukizwa. Ifute kwa maji ya sabuni au bleach iliyochanganywa na maji baada ya kila kazi ya uangalizi, itundike ikauke, na weka aproni tofauti kwa huduma binafsi na kwa jiko. Chagua aproni ndefu yenye kamba za shingo na kiuno zinazorekebishika. Afya inauza aproni imara inayotumika tena kwa walezi wa familia wanaotoa huduma ya mikono kila siku."],["Durable carer product that completes home-care baskets with gloves and pads.","Bidhaa ya kudumu ya walezi inayokamilisha vikapu vya huduma ya nyumbani pamoja na glavu na pedi."]],"fh_ppe_hair":[["Disposable bouffant caps cover the hair completely, stopping hairs and dandruff from falling into food and keeping hair clean during messy tasks; they are expected in food businesses and help home bakers, caterers and kitchen staff meet food-hygiene standards. Choose non-woven caps with soft elastic that hold all hair, including braids and locs, without pressing too tightly, and wear one per shift. They are also useful when dressing a wound or caring for someone with a weakened immune system. A pack of 100 lasts a small food business one to three months. Afya stocks them as a low-cost hygiene item for the food trade and event catering.","Kofia za kutupa zenye umbo la puto hufunika nywele zote, zikizuia nywele na mba kuanguka ndani ya chakula na kuweka nywele safi wakati wa kazi zinazochafua; zinatarajiwa katika biashara za chakula na huwasaidia waokaji wa nyumbani, wahudumu wa sherehe na wafanyakazi wa jikoni kufikia viwango vya usafi wa chakula. Chagua kofia za kitambaa kisichofumwa zenye mpira laini unaoshika nywele zote, zikiwemo nywele zilizosukwa na rasta, bila kubana sana, na vaa moja kwa kila zamu. Pia zinafaa wakati wa kufunga kidonda au kumhudumia mtu mwenye kinga dhaifu ya mwili. Pakiti ya 100 hudumu kwa biashara ndogo ya chakula mwezi mmoja hadi mitatu. Afya inaziuza kama bidhaa ya usafi ya gharama ndogo kwa biashara ya chakula na huduma za sherehe."],["Niche bulk item that opens business-to-business sales with caterers and food vendors.","Bidhaa maalum ya wingi inayofungua mauzo ya kibiashara kwa wahudumu wa sherehe na wauzaji wa chakula."]],"fh_hand_pocket":[["A pocket sanitiser lets people clean their hands when soap and water are not nearby — before eating street food, after using public transport or handling money, and at school. Choose a product with at least 60–70% alcohol, apply enough to cover all surfaces of the hands, and rub for about 20–30 seconds until dry. Sanitiser does not work well on visibly dirty or greasy hands, so wash with soap and water when you can, especially after the toilet and before preparing food. Supervise young children, keep it away from eyes and flames, and choose gels with moisturisers for frequent use. A 50–60 ml bottle lasts one person about two weeks. Afya stocks local, Kenyan and own-label pocket gels and sprays at the lowest prices in the zone.","Kitakasa mikono cha mfukoni huwawezesha watu kusafisha mikono pale ambapo sabuni na maji haviko karibu — kabla ya kula chakula cha mitaani, baada ya kutumia usafiri wa umma au kushika pesa, na shuleni. Chagua bidhaa yenye angalau asilimia 60–70 ya alkoholi, paka kiasi cha kutosha kufunika sehemu zote za mikono, na sugua kwa takriban sekunde 20–30 hadi ikauke. Kitakasa mikono hakifanyi kazi vizuri kwenye mikono inayoonekana michafu au yenye mafuta, hivyo nawa kwa sabuni na maji unapoweza, hasa baada ya choo na kabla ya kuandaa chakula. Wasimamie watoto wadogo, kiweke mbali na macho na moto, na chagua jeli zenye kilainishi kwa matumizi ya mara kwa mara. Chupa ya ml 50–60 hudumu kwa mtu mmoja takriban wiki mbili. Afya inauza jeli na dawa za kunyunyiza za mfukoni za hapa nchini, za Kenya na za chapa ya Afya kwa bei za chini zaidi katika eneo hili."],["Cheap, high-frequency impulse buy for every school bag and a showcase for Afya own-label.","Ununuzi wa ghafla nafuu wa mara kwa mara kwa kila begi la shule na mfano wa bidhaa za chapa ya Afya."]],"fh_hand_pump":[["Pump bottles of 250–525 ml placed at the front door, kitchen counter, office desk or shop till make hand hygiene a habit for everyone who passes, which is how sanitiser has the most impact. Choose at least 60–70% alcohol, and a moisturising formula for staff who use it many times a day. One press is usually enough for both hands; rub all surfaces, including thumbs and fingertips, for 20–30 seconds until dry. Keep bottles out of direct sun and away from flames, and refill them only from a sealed refill of the same product. Afya stocks value, mid and premium pumps, so homes and small businesses can place sanitiser wherever hands need it.","Chupa zenye pampu za ml 250–525 zilizowekwa mlangoni, kwenye kaunta ya jikoni, meza ya ofisini au kaunta ya malipo dukani hufanya usafi wa mikono kuwa tabia kwa kila anayepita, na hivyo ndivyo kitakasa mikono kinavyoleta matokeo makubwa zaidi. Chagua chenye angalau asilimia 60–70 ya alkoholi, na fomula yenye kilainishi kwa wafanyakazi wanaokitumia mara nyingi kwa siku. Kubonyeza mara moja kwa kawaida kunatosha kwa mikono yote miwili; sugua sehemu zote, zikiwemo vidole gumba na ncha za vidole, kwa sekunde 20–30 hadi ikauke. Weka chupa mbali na jua moja kwa moja na moto, na zijaze tena kutoka kwenye kijazo kilichofungwa cha bidhaa hiyo hiyo tu. Afya inauza pampu za bei nafuu, ya kati na ya juu, ili nyumba na biashara ndogo ziweke kitakasa mikono kila mahali mikono inapokihitaji."],["Steady seller to homes and small businesses that leads into bulk refills.","Inauzika kwa uthabiti kwa nyumba na biashara ndogo na huongoza kwenye vijazo vya wingi."]],"fh_hand_refill":[["Bulk sanitiser in 1–5 litre containers is the most economical way for schools, offices, clinics, places of worship and large households to keep pump bottles and dispensers filled, cutting the cost per use substantially. Refill only clean, dry bottles of the same product, never top up a half-full bottle that may be contaminated, and label every refilled bottle. Store containers tightly closed, upright, out of the sun and away from flames, because alcohol is flammable. Check that the product has at least 60–70% alcohol and is registered for sale. Afya stocks a local 5-litre refill and a premium moisturising hand rub used in healthcare, supporting business-to-business accounts.","Kitakasa mikono cha wingi katika madumu ya lita 1–5 ndiyo njia yenye gharama nafuu zaidi kwa shule, ofisi, kliniki, nyumba za ibada na kaya kubwa kuweka chupa za pampu na vifaa vya kutolea vikiwa vimejaa, na hupunguza gharama kwa kila matumizi kwa kiasi kikubwa. Jaza tena chupa safi na kavu za bidhaa hiyo hiyo tu, kamwe usiongeze kwenye chupa iliyojaa nusu ambayo inaweza kuwa imechafuka, na weka lebo kwenye kila chupa iliyojazwa tena. Hifadhi madumu yakiwa yamefungwa vizuri, yamesimama wima, mbali na jua na moto, kwa sababu alkoholi huwaka moto. Hakikisha bidhaa ina angalau asilimia 60–70 ya alkoholi na imesajiliwa kuuzwa. Afya inauza kijazo cha lita 5 cha hapa nchini na dawa ya hali ya juu ya kusugua mikono yenye kilainishi inayotumika katika huduma za afya, ikiunga mkono akaunti za kibiashara."],["High-ticket bulk line that anchors institutional and business accounts.","Bidhaa ya wingi ya bei kubwa inayoimarisha akaunti za taasisi na biashara."]],"fh_hand_liquid":[["Washing hands with soap and water is one of the most effective ways to prevent diarrhoea, cholera, typhoid and respiratory infections, and a pump bottle of liquid soap at every sink makes it quicker and more hygienic than a shared, wet bar. Wet hands, apply soap, and rub palms, backs, between fingers, thumbs and under nails for at least 20 seconds before rinsing and drying with a clean towel. Plain soap is enough for everyday use; antibacterial soaps suit homes caring for someone ill. Key moments are after the toilet, after changing nappies, before preparing food and before eating. A 400–500 ml bottle lasts a family about two to four weeks. Afya stocks local value soaps and trusted antibacterial brands, with refill sizes to cut cost.","Kunawa mikono kwa sabuni na maji ni mojawapo ya njia zenye ufanisi zaidi za kuzuia kuharisha, kipindupindu, homa ya matumbo na maambukizi ya njia ya hewa, na chupa ya sabuni ya maji yenye pampu kwenye kila sinki hufanya kunawa kuwe haraka na safi zaidi kuliko mche wa sabuni wenye unyevu unaotumiwa na wote. Lowesha mikono, weka sabuni, na sugua viganja, migongo ya mikono, katikati ya vidole, vidole gumba na chini ya kucha kwa angalau sekunde 20 kabla ya kusuuza na kukausha kwa taulo safi. Sabuni ya kawaida inatosha kwa matumizi ya kila siku; sabuni za kuua bakteria zinafaa nyumba zinazomhudumia mgonjwa. Nyakati muhimu ni baada ya choo, baada ya kubadilisha nepi, kabla ya kuandaa chakula na kabla ya kula. Chupa ya ml 400–500 hudumu kwa familia takriban wiki mbili hadi nne. Afya inauza sabuni za bei nafuu za hapa nchini na chapa zinazoaminika za kuua bakteria, pamoja na saizi za kujaza tena ili kupunguza gharama."],["Fast-moving weekly staple with local value brands and trusted premium options.","Bidhaa ya msingi inayouzika haraka kila wiki yenye chapa nafuu za hapa nchini na chaguo zinazoaminika za bei ya juu."]],"fh_hand_bar":[["Bar soap is the most affordable way to keep handwashing going every day, and antibacterial bars are popular in Tanzanian homes for both handwashing and bathing. Any soap removes germs when hands are rubbed thoroughly for 20 seconds; the key is to use it at the critical moments and to keep the bar on a draining soap dish so it stays dry and does not grow germs. For handwashing stations without a sink, a bar in a mesh bag tied beside a tippy-tap or bucket with a tap keeps it clean and prevents loss. People with very dry or sensitive skin may prefer milder, moisturising bars. Afya stocks small and large trusted antibacterial bars and a herbal option at value prices.","Sabuni ya mche ndiyo njia nafuu zaidi ya kudumisha kunawa mikono kila siku, na miche ya kuua bakteria hupendwa katika nyumba za Tanzania kwa kunawa mikono na kuoga. Sabuni yoyote huondoa vijidudu mikono ikisuguliwa vizuri kwa sekunde 20; jambo muhimu ni kuitumia katika nyakati muhimu na kuweka mche kwenye kisahani cha sabuni kinachotoa maji ili ubaki mkavu na usiote vijidudu. Kwa vituo vya kunawa mikono visivyo na sinki, mche ndani ya mfuko wa wavu uliofungwa kando ya kibuyu-chirizi au ndoo yenye bomba huuweka safi na kuzuia kupotea. Watu wenye ngozi kavu sana au nyeti wanaweza kupendelea miche laini yenye kilainishi. Afya inauza miche midogo na mikubwa inayoaminika ya kuua bakteria na chaguo la mitishamba kwa bei nafuu."],["Lowest-cost hygiene product with universal demand and multi-buy potential.","Bidhaa ya usafi ya gharama ya chini kabisa yenye mahitaji kwa wote na uwezekano wa kununua nyingi kwa pamoja."]]};window.dispatchEvent(new Event("afyatx"));